m/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/commits/8a06f6b7884bbf755347550688815d983b416ffc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:04:36Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:04:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: introduce typed Effect errors across host, CLI, and plugin runtimes (#302)\n\nPort of NEARBuilders/citynode.app#317 (host + packages only). Tagged\nerrors replace hand-rolled Error subclasses; every-plugin''s initialize\ncontract narrows to PluginRuntimeError; orchestrator schema-encodes\nBOS_RUNTIME_CONFIG (omitting undefined fields).","tree":{"sha":"fb974d1258c8a94b21ca12bcc97c90d44ff6812c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/git/trees/fb974d1258c8a94b21ca12bcc97c90d44ff6812c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/git/commits/8a06f6b7884bbf755347550688815d983b416ffc","verification":{"payload":"tree fb974d1258c8a94b21ca12bcc97c90d44ff6812c\nparent f9d2dce029528d0b08599936c982c52cd0ee9c00\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1791162276 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791162276 -0500\n\nrefactor: introduce typed Effect errors across host, CLI, and plugin runtimes (#302)\n\nPort of NEARBuilders/citynode.app#317 (host + packages only). Tagged\nerrors replace hand-rolled Error subclasses; every-plugin''s initialize\ncontract narrows to PluginRuntimeError; orchestrator schema-encodes\nBOS_RUNTIME_CONFIG (omitting undefined fields).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwvekCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASu8QAGcoKxS4+3eYSe8tdsVAasCX\nGgyloHpELkrgqVmfbzFPrptbS2vLGdcwRoscPr1UdBvOREtT/zEcRbcz9Vr5mEB0\n6sZOuu/g4ZO4I8I3BBTuCRXYLZFBc7noX+9d1Pul8mP9p2vyz1azxy1w1uKu4s+u\nrQ2rABJCu2/r6hHawd+mpJMoi0pqdh