:{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:20:56Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T20:20:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: extract renderClientShell, fix e2e test failures (#233)\n\n* refactor: extract host middleware/routes, add api test suite\n\n- host: extract security middleware (cors/csrf/rate-limit/csp), static\n  asset proxy, and API oRPC route setup out of program.ts into dedicated\n  modules composed via SecurityMiddleware Live layer\n- host: emit site.webmanifest manifest link in renderClientShell and fix\n  runtime-remote test to assert it (drop stale BOS iframe assertion)\n- host: dedupe normalizeDomain/normalizeUrl/extractErrorDetails into\n  utils, remove inline duplicates from program/plugins/tenant-runtime\n- api: add vitest config, HTTP integration harness with typed oRPC\n  clients and injectable auth/org context, integration tests for ping/\n  authHealth/resolveTenant/preflight/testError, and PGlite unit tests\n  for TenantsService; fixes ''no test files found'' in test:api\n\n* fix: extract renderClientShell to routes/html.ts, fix e2e test failures\n\n- Extract renderClientShell from program.ts into host/src/routes/html.ts\n  (nonce now passed as param instead of recomputing CSP_STRICT)\n- Fix stale theme toggle locator: ''Toggle theme'' -> ''Switch to ... theme''\n- Fix proxy target json-proxy-target.ts:\n  - Return oRPC-compatible RPC format { json, meta } for /api/rpc/*\n  - Add stubs for /api/auth/get-session and /api/auth/near/list-accounts\n- Fix 18 host vitest failures: provide mock session in test render options\n- Replace stale assertion in ssr-bundled-runtime test\n- Document bun run --cwd host test in AGENTS.md\n\n* refactor: extract static-proxy middleware, SSR handler, and config builder from program.ts\n\n- Inline proxyUiAssetRequest at its single call site\n- Extract buildRuntimeClientConfig, resolveActiveRuntime, getFallbackGatewayId\n  to services/config.ts\n- Extract static asset proxy middleware (lines 198-222) to\n  middleware/static-proxy.ts as createStaticAssetProxyHandler()\n- Extract SSR fallback handler (lines 226-298) to\n  routes/ssr.ts as createSsrFallbackHandler()\n- Remove unused imports from program.ts\n- buildRuntimeClientConfig now takes authAvailable: boolean instead of\n  plugins: PluginResult to avoid circular dependency\n\n* clean up plans","tree":{"sha":"2f61cff0d4a66bef231748f4895041c978f79d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/git/trees/2f61cff0d4a66bef231748f4895041c978f79d78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/git/commits/4a1ffa2b2a1bf25cfbe19e10fb01eba789c33173","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f61cff0d4a66bef231748f4895041c978f79d78\nparent ae8c34996394b9c4029cfcc6e237beedfe46eab2\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1786566056 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786566056 -0500\n\nfix: extract renderClientShell, fix e2e test failures (#233)\n\n* refactor: extract host middleware/routes, add api test suite\n\n- host: extract security middleware (cors/csrf/rate-limit/csp), static\n  asset proxy, and API oRPC route setup out of program.ts into dedicated\n  modules composed via SecurityMiddleware Live layer\n- host: emit site.webmanifest manifest link in renderClientShell and fix\n  runtime-remote test to assert it (drop stale BOS iframe assertion)\n- host: dedupe normalizeDomain/normalizeUrl/extractErrorDetails into\n  utils, remove inline duplicates from program/plugins/tenant-runtime\n- api: add vitest config, HTTP integration harness with typed oRPC\n  clients and injectable auth/org context, integration tests for ping/\n  authHealth/resolveTenant/preflight/testError, and PGlite unit tests\n  for TenantsService; fixes ''no test files found'' in test:api\n\n* fix: extract renderClientShell to routes/html.ts, fix e2e test failures\n\n- Extract renderClientShell from program.ts into host/src/routes/html.ts\n  (nonce now passed as param instead of recomputing CSP_STRICT)\n- Fix stale theme toggle locator: ''Toggle theme'' -> ''Switch to ... theme''\n- Fix proxy target json-proxy-target.ts:\n  - Return oRPC-compatible RPC format { json, meta } for /api/rpc/*\n  - Add stubs for /api/auth/get-session and /api/auth/near/list-accounts\n- Fix 18 host vitest failures: provide mock session in test render options\n- Replace stale assertion in ssr-bundled-runtime test\n- Document bun run --cwd host test in AGENTS.md\n\n* refactor: extract static-proxy middleware, SSR handler, and config builder from program.ts\n\n- Inline proxyUiAssetRequest at its single call site\n- Extract buildRuntimeClientConfig, resolveActiveRuntime, getFallbackGatewayId\n  to services/config.ts\n- Extract static asset proxy middleware (lines 198-222) to\n  middleware/static-proxy.ts as createStaticAssetProxyHandler()\n- Extract SSR fallback handler (lines 226-298) to\n  routes/ssr.ts as createSsrFallbackHandler()\n- Remove unused imports from program.ts\n- buildRuntimeClientConfig now takes authAvailable: boolean instead of\n  plugins: PluginResult to avoid circular dependency\n\n* clean up plans","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfNWoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALUEQAD9WS1Q7WeISuFfzmeMDLqqV\n4Q1pU4WVWMSabzRatqiBS2Dt1gEDKxHOSakVkEmV2p4sqC6Lht8EWSzyybSKg096\nDIXxW2dbyMO5u3hCRcTPKZHQL8yqJWvMFOvedsGR/0TB/k3R6KwwcnkDFbWop4WG\nN2C+X+IofRAP1CuZ9MXuGTwjPRrF3PsVOsXK+jJepXX7ytLyfoIP8+mlvJGGNXfM\njRV3+lygrry4al7ASr8GjecFbb0aPJ3pPv3XnH8Xp4O3jVF1jhhifwXPWeFz++v7\ndFwfAi7hTfQHpsqsiMXCDFlTmI50J8GzU1FA+Pa/+18yEdgZKEbSW2z5VJjILwas\nK6PBCuroQroELYIyZZ8T/UX6fSz6lB529hM0NGqpXm6CAsf0RJhPVs/8XpUG+979\n4VP9H1TpH9yDc4vqg6mtdbWzFoHMbRYf9LziRhgeFAi1XwXOjoVqeZn13rVKsYtU\ntzH+Xd38COrsavBF4Un26ho561jYr3q2hV/8zcgfMnd4CuJ+Uvi7FKH4SWUv7Vro\nluXZLWJZAOxAc172PEJAZvkYm7RGtP0hHphT21IAswfgqp9v6uVUdrP0zU5XazzG\ntG+agGbmXeJMp1COlVMokxITvbQgwtzYBbHWBKEYaFx/Wbrlv9rIFShgGDdzkZRj\nOPyabVerdjlvRm+G65SG\n=kY