ithub.com/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/commit/3a97c308f576dc7080755618fae538e4dcf9b12d","node_id":"C_kwDORq8oVtoAKDNhOTdjMzA4ZjU3NmRjNzA4MDc1NTYxOGZhZTUzOGU0ZGNmOWIxMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/commit/d03dd58e8010ce166a208198345f4c7ef6bbfea6","sha":"d03dd58e8010ce166a208198345f4c7ef6bbfea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/commits/d03dd58e8010ce166a208198345f4c7ef6bbfea6"}],"sha":"3a97c308f576dc7080755618fae538e4dcf9b12d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/commits/3a97c308f576dc7080755618fae538e4dcf9b12d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/everything-dev/commits/d03dd58e8010ce166a208198345f4c7ef6bbfea6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:01:17Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T17:01:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Adds regression tests (#214)\n\n* regression test wip\n\n* chore: update deployment URLs [skip ci]\n\n* errors\n\n* chore: update deployment URLs [skip ci]\n\n* misc\n\n* chore: update deployment URLs [skip ci]\n\n* chore: version packages (#212)\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update deployment URLs [skip ci]\n\n* client only navbar\n\n* chore: update deployment URLs [skip ci]\n\n* chore: version packages (#213)\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: update deployment URLs [skip ci]\n\n* chore: add black-box regression test suite\n\nIntroduce HTTP-level (Go) and browser-level (Playwright) regression tests\nat tests/regression/ that verify boot, auth, API, and UI composition\nagainst a running dev server.\n\n- Add Go test suite with helpers for HTTP assertions, session auth flow,\n  API key flow, plugin passthrough, OpenAPI surface, boot surface, and\n  metadata checks\n- Add Playwright test suite verifying page load, hydration, runtime config,\n  API client, auth client, and anonymous sign-in flow\n- Configure Playwright webServer at top-level (was per-project, silently\n  ignored) with REGRESSION_MODE env var for dev/prod selection\n- Add Github Actions regression job in ci.yml with Postgres services,\n  Go 1.22, Playwright browser, runs on every PR and push to main\n- Fix CSRF middleware hostname comparison (strip port from Host header)\n  to allow browser POST requests on non-standard ports\n- Add BOS_NO_PERSIST_PORTS env var to prevent regression test port flags\n  from being persisted to infra-state.json\n- Add stale port cleanup to Go test runner to fix race condition on\n  back-to-back runs\n- Reset dev ports in infra-state.json back to 3000 defaults\n\n* fix(every-plugin,ui): plugin init failure recovery and hydrate resilience\n\n- Evict failed plugin initializations from Effect.cached cache so\n  retry calls work instead of returning a permanently-cached failure\n- Close plugin scope on initialize failure to release DB pools/caches\n  that would otherwise leak until process exit\n- Construct router once per plugin instance, not per createClient call\n- Escape inline script JSON (</script>, U+2028, U+2029) to prevent XSS\n- Clear __EVERYTHING_DEV_HYDRATE_PROMISE__ on failure so retries succeed\n- Inject explicit __EVERYTHING_DEV_SSR__ flag for reliable SSR detection\n- Expand .env.example with all secret placeholders grouped by app section\n\n* test: broaden hydration detection and add interactivity checks\n\n- Broaden hydration error pattern matching in page-ready.ts to catch\n  non-fatal warnings (console.error) in addition to fatal hydration errors\n- Add console message listener for hydration-related warnings\n- Add interactivity test: click assistant button, navigate to /skill,\n  proving React hydrated and client-side routing works\n- Add Settings link interaction to auth sign-in test, proving\n  authenticated layout hydrates and navigation works\n\n* test: add sign-out, error shape, and CORS tests to HTTP suite\n\n- Add sign-out lifecycle test: POST /api/auth/sign-out with Origin\n  header, then verify session is gone via get-session\n- Add error response shape test: invalid input returns structured JSON\n  with code/message (not HTML), non-existent route returns JSON\n- Add CORS headers test: verify Access-Control-Allow-Origin is present\n  on /health and root page, with and without explicit Origin header\n\n* wip\n\n* lint\n\n* fix(regression): add BETTER_AUTH_SECRET to CI env and improve test logging\n\n* fix workflow\n\n* debug: log auth cookies and headers to diagnose CI session issue\n\n* fix: strip Secure flag from auth cookies in dev mode\n\n* fix(regression): match redirected settings/profile URL in browser test\n\n* chore: gitignore test-results/\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a25af780c0a0287dc896cf80a9180f4f68f0e03c"