orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/735bb977e2da6bd77c3376724ab06a67d3b95597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T23:40:58Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T23:40:58Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"docs(aprendizado): adicionar Fase 07 — Testes Avançados & Filosofia de Design\n\nParte 1: filosofia de design Go — composição sobre herança, interfaces\nimplícitas, accept interfaces/return structs, small interfaces, functional\noptions, pacotes como unidade de design, wiring manual.\n\nParte 2: testes avançados — stub, spy, mock e fake manuais com interfaces,\ntestify/mock, testify/assert vs require, teste de handlers com service\nmockado, teste de HTTP clients com httptest.Server, teste de banco\n(sqlmock, transação com rollback, testcontainers), teste de middleware,\ntestes de integração, fixtures e helpers.","tree":{"sha":"dbdbe74a3bbdee9b5149df2dca91241fbfd924e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/dbdbe74a3bbdee9b5149df2dca91241fbfd924e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/735bb977e2da6bd77c3376724ab06a67d3b95597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/p