ezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/d49857b1a475f24cd55f5f1a58f1b7aec7098404/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:07:03Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:07:03Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"style(mobile-bff): aplicar convenções Uber e Google Go Style Guide\n\n- Substituir var []T por make([]T, 0) em repositórios que retornam via JSON\n  para garantir serialização como [] em vez de null\n- Adicionar asserções de interface em tempo de compilação (var _ I = (*T)(nil))\n  para PokemonService, FavoriteService, PostgresPokemonRepository,\n  PostgresFavoriteRepository, PokemonCatalogServiceRepository e AuthServiceClient\n- Converter constante defaultAuthRateLimitWindowSeconds (int) para\n  defaultAuthRateLimitWindow (time.Duration), eliminando 3 casts repetidos\n- Refatorar 5 funções de teste isoladas em TestAuthServiceClientErrorMapping\n  com subtests table-driven; remover campo wantPath não utilizado da struct\n- Adicionar skill go-style-combined com síntese completa do Uber Go Style Guide\n  e Google Go Style Guide, incluindo decisões específicas do projeto","tree":{"sha":"b20e8a48095a415be6f0ae35df63168ee50f6526","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/b20e8a48095a415be6f0ae35df63168ee50f6526"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/d49857b1a475f24cd55f5f1a58f1b7aec7098404","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gith