zal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/a012d4e1babb23c17afe7001863893d61383a750/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T23:35:46Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T23:35:46Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"docs: atualizar documentacao pos-refatoracao hexagonal e slog\n\nSincroniza doc/ e READMEs com o estado atual do codigo apos as 5 fases\nde refatoracao hexagonal e a adicao do slog.\n\ncore/bff/mobile-bff/README.md:\n- Arvore de arquitetura reflete a estrutura real:\n  adapters/inbound/http/, adapters/outbound/{http,postgres}/,\n  infrastructure/logger/, ports/{inbound,outbound}/ por arquivo.\n- Adiciona tabela de variaveis de ambiente incluindo LOG_LEVEL e LOG_FORMAT.\n- Exemplo de execucao local demonstra LOG_FORMAT=text.\n\ndoc/architecture/hexagonal.md:\n- Secao 4 (estrutura de pastas) atualizada com arvore fiel ao codigo.\n- Diagrama de dependencia corrigido: adapters/inbound/http e adapters/outbound.\n- Checklist atualizado com os caminhos reais dos pacotes.\n- Adiciona nota sobre infrastructure/logger (inicializado em main, fora do\n  hexagono).\n\ndoc/README.md:\n- Adiciona link para architecture/hexagonal.md no indice.\n\ndoc/bff/, doc/ddd/, doc/design-patterns/:\n- Removidas (pastas vazias sem referencia no indice).","tree":{"sha":"416357d5c944f1c347f96664a5dbdcbe50c4a901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/416357d5c944f1c347f96664a5dbdcbe50c4a901"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/a012d4e1babb23c17afe7001863893d61383a750","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commit/a012d4e1babb23c17afe7001863893d61383a750","node_id":"C_kwDORrPASdoAKGEwMTJkNGUxYmFiYjIzYzE3YWZlNzAwMTg2Mzg5M2Q2MTM4M2E3NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commit/122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987","sha":"122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987"}],"sha":"a012d4e1babb23c17afe7001863893d61383a750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/a012d4e1babb23c17afe7001863893d61383a750"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T23:18:59Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T23:18:59Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"feat(mobile-bff): adicionar slog estruturado e middleware de request logging\n\nSubstitui todos os log.Printf/Fatal/Println por slog estruturado (stdlib, sem\ndependencias externas). Cria pacote internal/infrastructure/logger com Setup()\ncentralizado que le LOG_LEVEL e LOG_FORMAT do ambiente.\n\n- logger.Setup(\"mobile-bff\") como primeira linha de main() define o logger\n  global via slog.SetDefault; demais pacotes chamam slog.Info/Warn/Error\n  diretamente, sem injecao de *slog.Logger.\n- log.Fatal substituido por slog.Error + os.Exit(1) para garantir flush do\n  buffer JSON antes de encerrar o processo.\n- AuthRateLimitMiddleware: log.Printf -> slog.Warn com campos chave-valor.\n- RequestLoggerMiddleware adicionado como camada mais externa do stack; loga\n  metodo, path, status HTTP e duracao em ms. Health checks ignorados para\n  evitar ruido em dashboards.\n- LOG_FORMAT=text ativa TextHandler para leitura local; padrao e JSON.","tree":{"sha":"35ccc34a6d62d75b013e7755425e6bbc27d5425a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/35ccc34a6d62d75b013e7755425e6bbc27d5425a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commit/122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987","node_id":"C_kwDORrPASdoAKDEyMjg2OGZiMmY0MDgwMGFlZjEyNTQyMWM2NTQyMTk5MGFhOTU5ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commit/444b9d006775daeb1153b263625dc05bf2010e2f","sha":"444b9d006775daeb1153b263625dc05bf2010e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/444b9d006775daeb1153b263625dc05bf2010e2f"}],"sha":"122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/122868fb2f40800aef125421c65421990aa95987"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/commits/444b9d006775daeb1153b263625dc05bf2010e2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T22:43:47Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T22:43:47Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"refactor(mobile-bff): corrigir violacoes arquiteturais no adapters/inbound\n\nFase 5 da refatoracao hexagonal — elimina dois acoplamentos proibidos:\n\n1. TokenValidator (ports/inbound): extrai interface para validacao de token,\n   implementada por AuthServiceClient (adapters/outbound/http). AuthMiddleware\n   recebe TokenValidator por injecao de dependencia, eliminando chamada HTTP\n   direta acoplada ao ambiente via os.Getenv.\n\n2. EnrichedResponseBuilder removido: o arquivo acoplava adapters/inbound\n   diretamente a outbound.FavoriteRepository e outbound.PokemonRepository.\n   Era codigo morto — nao instanciado fora do proprio arquivo. O enriquecimento\n   ja e tratado corretamente pelos use cases (FavoriteService, PokemonService).\n\nImpacto: middleware agora e testavel sem stub de HTTP externo; direcao de\ndependencias esta canonicamente correta em todos os adapters.","tree":{"sha":"7a9c6a8d868c039ee292a30fbeba5ee601f2f8bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/7a9c6a8d868c039ee292a30fbeba5ee601f2f8bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/444b9d006775daeb1153b263625dc05bf2010e2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal/poke