 Nascimento"},"message":"refactor(mobile-bff): reorganizar adapters/outbound em subpacotes postgres e httpclient\n\nFase 3 do refactor hexagonal canônico:\n- Criar adapters/outbound/postgres/ com Database, PostgresPokemonRepository e PostgresFavoriteRepository\n- Criar adapters/outbound/http/ (package httpclient) com AuthServiceClient e PokemonCatalogServiceRepository\n- Mocks autossuficientes em tests/mocks/ sem dependência do package repository\n- Atualizar cmd/server/main.go e tests/unit/ para os novos imports\n- Deletar adapters/repository/ (package legado)","tree":{"sha":"9a98a15682846d864913f4faad06f21e1aea5207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/9a98a15682846d864913f4faad06f21e1aea5207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/572d949c3fe8824732e654876c1704485257fa43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal/pokede