belezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"feat(mobile-bff): reforcar middleware de autenticacao e politicas de borda\n\n- Consulta endpoint de introspeccao do auth-service para barrar tokens revogados\n- Adiciona rate limiting em rotas de autenticacao (AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_*)\n- Restringe CORS com allowlist de origens (ALLOWED_ORIGINS) e credentials habilitados\n- Configura cookies Secure pelo cabecalho X-Forwarded-Proto em ambiente HTTPS\n- Impoe limite de payload JSON e desabilita campos desconhecidos nos handlers\n- Propaga RefreshToken no contrato de porta e cliente HTTP do auth-service\n- Endurece logout: revoga access token e refresh token no auth-service\n- Adiciona plugins request-size-limiting e rate-limiting no Kong para rota auth\n- Expande testes unitarios de middleware, handlers e cliente do auth-service","tree":{"sha":"09c95d40fe1018d2c1bce7de836aca5decbf8bd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/09c95d40fe1018d2c1bce7de836aca5decbf8bd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/4910dbd73d584935812e7446aba23d46cfe8ccd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u