":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T23:29:54Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T23:29:54Z","email":"17522772+lucabelezal@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lucas Nascimento"},"message":"feat(auth-service): implementar revogacao de access token e introspeccao de sessao\n\n- Adiciona campo jti nos access tokens JWT para rastreabilidade\n- Persiste tokens revogados em auth_revoked_access_tokens com TTL\n- Implementa endpoint POST /v1/auth/introspect para validar atividade do token\n- Rotaciona refresh token a cada uso (one-time-use) com armazenamento em banco\n- Revoga access e refresh tokens no logout com estado imediato\n- Adiciona job periodico de limpeza de artefatos expirados (AUTH_CLEANUP_INTERVAL_MINS)\n- Exige JWT_SECRET valido no boot sem fallback de segredo fraco\n- Migration incremental 001_auth_tokens_hardening.sql com script apply.sh\n- Cobre servico e handlers HTTP com testes unitarios","tree":{"sha":"4efc25e3cb40f4fbef8313db4f123fe45dc630cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/trees/4efc25e3cb40f4fbef8313db4f123fe45dc630cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucabelezal/pokedex-platform/git/commits/d6fa24ece0bbdf3f7c2b89fdc0faff372b7ed883","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17522772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucabelezal","id":17522772,"login":"lucabelezal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTIyNzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucabelezal/orgs","received_events_url