ep with a direct\n`${{ github.event.repository.name }}` expression in the build command.\nSwitch node-version to ''20'' (LTS, widely tested with Slidev).\nAdd continue-on-error to SRI step so a CDN hiccup can''t block a deploy.\nRemove the intermediate output-passing step that was a likely failure point.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05f8f39db9cb27253e9770d6bcad5da67e3ec35d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/05f8f39db9cb27253e9770d6bcad5da67e3ec35d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/d3ec8b1ca428cb420e9887e28bf4dbea49f5083e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/d3ec8b1ca428cb420e9887e28bf4dbea49f5083e","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGQzZWM4YjFjYTQyOGNiNDIwZTk4ODdlMjhiZjRkYmVhNDlmNTA4M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2","sha":"fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2"}],"sha":"d3ec8b1ca428cb420e9887e28bf4dbea49f5083e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/d3ec8b1ca428cb420e9887e28bf4dbea49f5083e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T14:21:26Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T14:21:26Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"empty just for triggering ci","tree":{"sha":"4517c20cc230bceb57390caa6c60aa9b01aa5363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/4517c20cc230bceb57390caa6c60aa9b01aa5363"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGZkNTU0YWU2MTA4ZTA0NDI3NzgyOTc1Njg1MDA2ZjJmZTQ0MjIzYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345","sha":"4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345"}],"sha":"fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/fd554ae6108e04427782975685006f2fe44223a2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T13:07:18Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T13:07:18Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"ci: fix lock-file error, opt into Node.js 24 actions runtime\n\n- Remove `cache: ''npm''` from all setup-node steps - npm caching requires\n  a lock file (package-lock.json) which is not committed; this was causing\n  \"Dependencies lock file is not found\" errors in release.yml.\n- Replace `npm ci` with `npm install --no-audit --no-fund` for the same\n  reason: npm ci requires a lock file.\n- Add `FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24: true` env var at workflow level\n  in all three workflows (check.yml, deploy.yml, release.yml) to opt into\n  the Node.js 24 actions runtime now and eliminate deprecation warnings\n  ahead of the June 2026 forced migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4517c20cc230bceb57390caa6c60aa9b01aa5363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/4517c20cc230bceb57390caa6c60aa9b01aa5363"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDQwMzViZThjNGYyYzg2NjM3OTM5Mzg0NzI2N2Q1OTZhMjczNzIzNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e","sha":"4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e"}],"sha":"4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/4035be8c4f2c866379393847267d596a27372345"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:59:34Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:59:34Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"fix: deploy Slidev to Pages, generate SRI hashes in CI, fix ESM export script\n\n- deploy.yml: Switch primary GH Pages deployment from static slides.html to\n  built Slidev SPA (npx slidev build); slides.html now served as /reveal.html.\n  Base path computed automatically from GITHUB_REPOSITORY. SRI hashes are\n  generated by scripts/add-sri.js before deployment.\n\n- check.yml: sri-check job now installs Node, runs add-sri.js to generate\n  hashes live in CI (GitHub Actions has network access), then verifies.\n  Eliminates the failing \"missing integrity attributes\" check.\n\n- release.yml: fix concept count 45 -> 47 in release body text.\n\n- scripts/export-reveal-pdf.js: rewrite from CommonJS (require/module.exports)\n  to ESM (import) to match \"type\": \"module\" in package.json; use\n  import.meta.url instead of __dirname.\n\n- slides.html: trim 5 oversized code blocks (Rate Limiting 32->17 lines,\n  Helmet 29->19, JWT 28->18, Secure Sessions 25->18, SSRF 25->17 lines);\n  fix JWT data-line-numbers step markers; remove X-XSS-Protection from\n  recommended Helmet example.\n\n- slides.md: trim 3 oversized code blocks (Broken AC 25->17, Session Mgmt\n  26->15, Rate Limiting 27->15 lines); remove X-XSS-Protection recommended\n  header.\n\n- 47-web-crypto-api.md: fix AES-ECB (not in Web Crypto API) -> AES-CBC with\n  fixed IV with explanatory comment.\n\n- 48-framework-security.md: replace placeholder ''some-html-escaping-lib''\n  with real ''escape-html'' npm package.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ccc8fe36781324ffd49b7bffab65245c4c57654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/4ccc8fe36781324ffd49b7bffab65245c4c57654"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDRiNzQwMWM2ZjQwMzAyY2QzMjBlMjYwY2ZlNWIzYmI0OGIxYjNmNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd","sha":"be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd"}],"sha":"4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/4b7401c6f40302cd320e260cfe5b3bb48b1b3f6e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:49:02Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:49:02Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"update lock","tree":{"sha":"669e95e0e746e8e6878128220bf1fa34579d41a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/669e95e0e746e8e6878128220bf1fa34579d41a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGJlN2NlMDY4MDU0YjY4ZGU2YTdlNTVhYTFhZWVlYzM3ODUzZTNmY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559","sha":"ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559"}],"sha":"be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/be7ce068054b68de6a7e55aa1aeeec37853e3fcd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:53Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:53Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"README: tone down over-claims, add architecture table, note gaps\n\n- Title: \"Complete Reference\" -> \"Reference\" (more honest)\n- Intro: removed \"research-ready\", added caveat (\"broad rather than\n  exhaustive — treat as a structured starting point\")\n- New Architecture section: table comparing Reveal.js vs Slidev,\n  states slides.html is source of truth\n- Numbering gap note: explains 12 and 26 are intentionally absent,\n  not errors\n- \"best-practice mitigations\" -> \"mitigations\" (less over-claiming)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"562dbb5fb1c75648c3a4bdaab5e12286deaafe46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/562dbb5fb1c75648c3a4bdaab5e12286deaafe46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGNlZWU3YmRjM2NlNWY0MDY1ZDJkNGU4OTljMTgwMGU4YmQ1Njg1NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6","sha":"0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6"}],"sha":"ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/ceee7bdc3ce5f4065d2d4e899c1800e8bd568559"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:45Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:45Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Fix X-XSS-Protection: remove from recommended code, label deprecated\n\nX-XSS-Protection was removed from Chrome 78+ and is a no-op in\nFirefox. It can introduce XSS vulnerabilities in older IE.\nModern guidance is to omit it entirely and use CSP instead.\n\n- 02-clickjacking.md: commented out the header in secure code block,\n  added inline note explaining deprecation\n- 32-mime-sniffing.md: same — commented out, noted legacy status\n- 39-security-misconfiguration.md:\n  - Helmet config block: replaced xssFilter block with accurate note\n    (Helmet 5+ disables it by default)\n  - Security headers checklist: changed ✓ to ✗ with explanation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ad509158b1106ea98aa08a40e97e270ce3f64a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/0ad509158b1106ea98aa08a40e97e270ce3f64a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDA0MjZmY2E3ZmI4OTQ0OWI1ZTBiZWZmMTk2NGYzNmNkMTgwNjAzZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6","sha":"184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6"}],"sha":"0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/0426fca7fb89449b5e0beff1964f36cd180603d6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:37Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:37Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Add SRI automation: scripts/add-sri.js + npm scripts + CDN comment\n\nscripts/add-sri.js:\n  - Fetches each CDN resource and computes SHA-384 hash\n  - Patches integrity= and crossorigin= attributes in slides.html\n  - --check mode exits 1 if any CDN tag lacks integrity (used by CI)\n\npackage.json:\n  - Added \"type\": \"module\" (required for ESM script)\n  - Added \"sri\" and \"sri:check\" npm scripts\n  - Updated description to reflect 47 concepts\n\nslides.html:\n  - Added comment pointing to add-sri.js near CDN links\n  - Pinned highlight.js from @11 (floating) to @11.9.0 (exact)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1797ad6d51ce4ce0cd60e9373c44093245365ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/1797ad6d51ce4ce0cd60e9373c44093245365ed9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDE4NDAxNmIyZTZiZTM4NzZkN2JjOWQyYTk1MzQ4MzdlZmQ5OWViYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153","sha":"a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153"}],"sha":"184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/184016b2e6be3876d7bc9d2a9534837efd99ebb6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:29Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:29Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Add quality-checks CI workflow (check.yml)\n\nFour jobs run on every push and PR to main:\n\nlink-check:\n  - Validates all local .md hrefs in README.md resolve to real files\n  - Validates all .md hrefs in slides.html reference library\n  - Validates all deep dive href=\"./file.md\" links in slides.md\n\nfile-count:\n  - Confirms all expected numbered concept files are present\n  - Knows about intentional gaps (12, 26) so it doesn''t false-alarm\n\nsri-check:\n  - Fails if any CDN <link>/<script> tag in slides.html is missing\n    an integrity= attribute (run `node scripts/add-sri.js` to fix)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f749199cf78b915ea26c8d39738d8d683ff3a8fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/f749199cf78b915ea26c8d39738d8d683ff3a8fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGE0YThhMGFjZDkzYjU2YWE2Y2IxMjkxNTRlMjg0ODVjNGM3N2IxNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f","sha":"69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f"}],"sha":"a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/a4a8a0acd93b56aa6cb129154e28485c4c77b153"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:21Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T12:42:21Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Add LICENSE (MIT) and CONTRIBUTING.md\n\nLICENSE: MIT, copyright Torsten Zielke 2025\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md covers:\n- Repo architecture (Reveal.js canonical vs Slidev companion)\n- How to add/fix concepts (template, file naming, where to update)\n- Running checks locally\n- SRI hash regeneration workflow (npm run sri)\n- Intentional numbering gaps (12, 26 removed)\n- Code of conduct reference\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32783275fc6798650f6df54cd3d1a73ff7ab1144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/32783275fc6798650f6df54cd3d1a73ff7ab1144"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDY5ZDEzYTk1ZTM0NThjOGE1YjdkNTQzNDNkZjNkZjEwMDY5ZjlkOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9","sha":"548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9"}],"sha":"69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/69d13a95e3458c8a5b7d54343df3df10069f9d8f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:55:16Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:55:16Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Polish slides: deep dive links, em-dashes to hyphens, emoji cleanup\n\nslides.md:\n- Convert all 18 \"📄 Deep dive: <code>file.md</code>\" hints to\n  clickable <a href> links (blue, dotted underline, opens in new tab)\n- Replace 116 em-dashes with hyphens throughout\n- Remove decorative emojis from prose headers (🔐 🛡 📖 📚 🛠);\n  keep functional ✅ ❌ 📄 and category circle emojis\n- titleTemplate: em-dash removed\n\nslides.html:\n- Replace 105 em-dashes with hyphens\n- Remove 🔐 from title slide and closing slide headings\n- Update \"45 Concepts\" → \"47 Concepts\" in <title> and subtitle\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"684baa62201050dff923b227ab7fbc60d3bce3f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/684baa62201050dff923b227ab7fbc60d3bce3f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDU0OGM1ZDExMmNiYjA4MDg4NmZjNjQ0ZDNjM2FkZjc3ZWRhMDRiZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3","sha":"bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3"}],"sha":"548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/548c5d112cbb080886fc644d3c3adf77eda04be9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:23:41Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:23:41Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Update Slidev deck: remove LDAP/cert-pinning, add 4 new concept slides\n\nRemoved:\n- ''12 · LDAP Injection'' entry from injection overview slide\n- ''26 · Certificate Pinning'' entry from transport overview slide\n- Updated index slide bullets to match\n\nAdded before Injection section:\n- ''46 · Micro-Frontend Security'' — Module Federation isolation,\n  shared state risks, SRI pinning, iframe sandboxing\n- ''48 · Framework Security'' — React dangerouslySetInnerHTML,\n  Vue v-html, Angular bypassSecurityTrustHtml, Next.js SSR XSS\n\nAdded before HTTP Headers section:\n- ''47 · Web Crypto API'' — Math.random vs crypto.subtle, AES-GCM,\n  PBKDF2 600k iterations, non-extractable IndexedDB keys\n- ''49 · Web Cache Poisoning'' — X-Forwarded-Host injection, cache\n  deception, CDN cache key rules, Cache-Control: no-store\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de1cf034c1de800f510d58764807b62289da7c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/de1cf034c1de800f510d58764807b62289da7c54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGJiNjUwMDE0ZTI3OWYxOTIzYTE4YTJkNDU2MTYzMDRmYjhkZjdkYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31","sha":"3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31"}],"sha":"bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/bb650014e279f1923a18a2d45616304fb8df7dc3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:22:04Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:22:04Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Update Reveal.js deck: remove 2 deprecated slides, add 4 new concepts\n\nRemoved:\n- LDAP Injection card from Injection overview slide\n- Certificate Pinning card and list item from Transport section\n\nAdded (Cat 1 — Client-Side Attack Vectors):\n- Slide 3.5: 46 — Micro-Frontend Security (Module Federation\n  isolation, shared token risks, CSP across remotes)\n- Slide 3.6: 48 — Framework Security (React dangerouslySetInnerHTML,\n  Vue v-html, Angular bypassSecurityTrustHtml, SSR injection)\n\nAdded (Cat 5 — Transport & Network Security):\n- Slide 7.2: 47 — Web Crypto API (AES-GCM, PBKDF2, secure IV,\n  IndexedDB key storage vs Math.random / ECB anti-patterns)\n- Slide 7.3: 49 — Web Cache Poisoning (unkeyed X-Forwarded-Host,\n  cache deception, CDN defences)\n\nReference Library updated: removed LDAP/cert-pinning links,\nadded all 4 new concept file links in correct categories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbb98f5b96a6a2bc58be628177ce3461eaeb7c98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/dbb98f5b96a6a2bc58be628177ce3461eaeb7c98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDNmNDkyOWFhNWVmNTMyNGUxODM3NGUzZGY5ODU5ZmFjYzNlN2FmMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb","sha":"2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb"}],"sha":"3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/3f4929aa5ef5324e18374e3df9859facc3e7af31"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:18:44Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:18:44Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Update README: reflect 47 concepts after additions and removals\n\n- Remove rows for 12 (LDAP Injection) and 26 (Certificate Pinning)\n- Add rows for 46 (MFE Security) and 48 (Framework Security) in Cat 1\n- Add rows for 47 (Web Crypto API) and 49 (Cache Poisoning) in Cat 5\n- Update intro blurb: \"45 concepts\" → \"47 concepts\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5afefe3edbd80ab9dc2c05cdfa7055f29b57d40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/e5afefe3edbd80ab9dc2c05cdfa7055f29b57d40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDI0MTRmYTg5N2FhMzRiNDRmZWRlYjcxZTI4NGE2YjM4NDQxZmQyZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f","sha":"aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f"}],"sha":"2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/2414fa897aa34b44fedeb71e284a6b38441fd2fb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:17:41Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:17:41Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Add 4 new concepts; remove LDAP injection and Certificate Pinning\n\nAdded (per Gemini feedback):\n- 46-microfrontend-security.md — Module Federation isolation, shared\n  token risks, cross-MFE XSS, CSP challenges, untrusted remotes\n- 47-web-crypto-api.md — Web Crypto API correct usage, AES-GCM,\n  PBKDF2, key storage, avoiding Math.random and ECB mode\n- 48-framework-security.md — React dangerouslySetInnerHTML, Vue v-html,\n  Angular DomSanitizer bypasses, SSR injection, hydration XSS\n- 49-web-cache-poisoning.md — Unkeyed headers, cache deception,\n  CDN-specific risks (Cloudflare/Vercel/Fastly), fat GET attacks\n\nRemoved (flagged as niche/legacy for modern JS stacks):\n- 12-ldap-injection.md — LDAP rare in modern JS/OIDC stacks\n- 26-certificate-pinning.md — HPKP deprecated in browsers\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11bcf8f00636041f1fabda8b5132b9e1a3e2bc00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/11bcf8f00636041f1fabda8b5132b9e1a3e2bc00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGFmZjY1OTcwZmZjNTY4OTU5YjI1MzZiZTc0NTE5Y2M0MjE0OTZhMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076","sha":"3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076"}],"sha":"aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/aff65970ffc568959b2536be74519cc421496a1f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:10:46Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:10:46Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Add Reference Library section to Reveal.js deck\n\nNew 2D section (10 slides) at the end of the presentation:\n- Intro slide with prominent links to README.md and AGENT.md\n- 9 vertical sub-slides, one per category, each listing all\n  concept files as styled clickable links (.ref-link)\n- Category colour coding matches the rest of the deck\n- .ref-link CSS class added with hover highlight effect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25ede9eec65b0a23bdad543358f1249fec8822e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/25ede9eec65b0a23bdad543358f1249fec8822e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDNiZWNlNDkyOTYwOWFhNzBhNjM2ZDkzYzUxMWZkODY0MTdlMTEwNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037","sha":"83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037"}],"sha":"3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/3bece4929609aa70a636d93c511fd86417e11076"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:07:25Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T10:07:25Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Remove ''Category N'' prefix from Slidev section slides; add AGENT.md\n\n- slides.md: all 9 category intro slides now show the topic name\n  prominently with an inspirational security quote — no more\n  ''Category 1 / Client-Side Attack Vectors'' wording\n- AGENT.md: new agent guide covering automated discovery, static\n  analysis grep patterns, prioritisation matrix (Critical→Info),\n  remediation code snippets, and a concept reference index\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28df722e26339eb0542efb18eb3967a2e6e2a555","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/28df722e26339eb0542efb18eb3967a2e6e2a555"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDgzZmY3ZGU4MTZlMmRkMWRkZTVlMTk5NDJhNjk3MTQ0Nzk0MTEwMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf","sha":"0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf"}],"sha":"83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/83ff7de816e2dd1dde5e19942a69714479411037"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:39:30Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:39:30Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"feat: add 2D Reveal.js presentation + fix GitHub Actions\n\nPresentation (slides.html — Reveal.js 5.1.0):\n- True 2D navigation: right/space moves between categories (horizontal),\n  down dives into concept slides within each section (vertical)\n- 9 category section intro slides with emoji, gradient title, no \"Category\"\n  prefix, and inspirational security quote per section\n- 18 step-animated code blocks (data-line-numbers with | stepping)\n- 80 fragment animations for progressive reveal of bullets/cards\n- Complete coverage of all 45 concepts across 9 categories\n- Self-contained HTML — no local dependencies, CDN only\n\nscripts/export-reveal-pdf.js:\n- Playwright script to export slides.html via Reveal.js ?print-pdf mode\n\nGitHub Actions — version updates:\n- deploy.yml: configure-pages v4 → v5 (required update)\n- deploy.yml: now deploys slides.html as index.html (2D presentation\n  is the primary GitHub Pages site; Slidev build is optional/commented)\n- deploy.yml: removed unnecessary Playwright install (not needed for deploy)\n- release.yml: Node.js 20 → 22 (current LTS)\n- release.yml: adds Reveal.js PDF export step (js-security-reveal-presentation.pdf)\n- release.yml: release now uploads 3 PDFs: Reveal, Slidev, combined markdown\n- release.yml: fail_on_unmatched_files: false (graceful if Slidev PDF fails)\n- Both workflows: all action versions verified against 2025 latest\n\npackage.json:\n- Added \"present\" script: npx serve . for local HTML preview\n- Added \"export:reveal-pdf\" script using scripts/export-reveal-pdf.js\n- Updated devDependencies: playwright-chromium → playwright@^1.50.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf170ae08baaaf6192bc8e84fdbf3dff3eb09a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/bf170ae08baaaf6192bc8e84fdbf3dff3eb09a4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKDAzOTNlOWMzNGQ2ODlkMzRmZmVjMTg2MTc5MWM5MzE3MGFjNWNhYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1","sha":"ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1"}],"sha":"0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/0393e9c34d689d34ffec1861791c93170ac5caaf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:22:54Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:22:54Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"fix(slides): resolve 3 presentability issues found in validation\n\n- Replace 5 unsupported ```http language tags with ```bash so Shiki\n  renders them correctly (affected: Clickjacking, HSTS, Referrer Policy,\n  Permissions Policy, MIME Sniffing slides)\n\n- Fix slide ordering in Category 4 (Auth): was 17 → 19 → 18,\n  now correctly flows 17 → 18 → 19 → 20-22; expanded slide 18\n  (Authentication Failures) with bcrypt/MFA/HaveIBeenPwned examples;\n  renamed \"18, 20-22 Auth Deep Dives\" → \"20-22 OAuth, Sessions & IDOR\"\n  with improved session fixation and logout code examples\n\n- Add missing slide \"35 & 36 — Outdated Components & Third-Party Scripts\"\n  (were promised in overview but had no dedicated slide); covers npm audit,\n  Dependabot, Renovate, sandboxed iframes, SRI for vendor scripts, CSP\n  restrictions\n\nTotal slides: 49 → 51 (net +2 concept slides added)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c9911dafb8eb5346033c82af247832e1ec08bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/0c9911dafb8eb5346033c82af247832e1ec08bed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1","node_id":"C_kwDORrTtRNoAKGVlODEwNDg1NmEzYjc3MzI2YTliY2NlNTA1ZjdjNWYxNmI2MTYxZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commit/e76cff6bfb75affbc75f5408dbd9dd387acfe506","sha":"e76cff6bfb75affbc75f5408dbd9dd387acfe506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/e76cff6bfb75affbc75f5408dbd9dd387acfe506"}],"sha":"ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/ee8104856a3b77326a9bcce505f7c5f16b6161e1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/commits/e76cff6bfb75affbc75f5408dbd9dd387acfe506/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:18:34Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:18:34Z","email":"hrymir.nortt@gmail.com","name":"Torsten Zielke"},"message":"Initial commit: Complete JS & Frontend Security Reference\n\n- README.md: Overview of 45 security concepts across 9 categories\n- slides.md: Full Slidev presentation covering all concepts with code examples\n- 45 deep-dive markdown files (01-45) with full explanations, attack scenarios, and mitigations\n- package.json: Slidev dev/build/export npm scripts\n- .gitignore: Standard Node.js ignores\n- .github/workflows/deploy.yml: Auto-deploy Slidev SPA to GitHub Pages on push to main\n- .github/workflows/release.yml: On version tag, export Slidev PDF + combine all\n  markdown files into single reference PDF, both uploaded as GitHub Release artifacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb3e7bdf924426d4d5f22b0a4322da6d60c5dfd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/trees/eb3e7bdf924426d4d5f22b0a4322da6d60c5dfd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iVivid-GmbH/javascript-security/git/commits/e76cff6bfb75affbc75f5408dbd