ui-components/git/trees/17adad4239ebd56135fe750a48dcc0dc205a234c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/frame-ui-components/git/commits/10c4def7882a338b0d89f909b2e0f3c676d1d3c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 17adad4239ebd56135fe750a48dcc0dc205a234c\nparent 4f2778445a4177df09046493fb1d4388db5f5e79\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1775765093 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775765093 -0500\n\nfix: point tokens export types at source for file: link compatibility (#13)\n\nThe ./tokens subpath export had types pointing at ./dist/tokens.d.ts,\nwhich doesn''t exist when consumed via pnpm file: links (no build step).\nPoint types at ./src/tokens.ts instead — this file is already in the\nfiles array, so it works for both file: links and npm consumers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2AZlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJB4QACU6buudUba6tF80D/ZnwGNQ\nVcPCyy7NOwObxeRWc7pJTXbj6jgX/5ejtvdaovN8HJaPVyzVNczQ0dfuj6DP/wIB\n2Xv0AseTBQA3BrhLvAkrMetj/CNGlSi14Bgb2HjzppWB3oJCoIyzbHQtG8HBUw5k\n44abBPvW/RqxkcjqwNayIK2JlAfOCn8Y/16nIAiP6YGrvELqnJKH4bo15/x046f8\ni28td54MwkWNRp4JrQz45gvRvl5pQgNHIguMRYKO4uL4TOmSngh7ARWjhiwP6GYb\nbH7hZzMiDXlvAYiavKO6voWCXtVwt1Q1F2dSp+fTXqE75qKMY1+UBH6BTAv2max3\nyNGKu1kuPT4cmZ0zC2O2loIlNuPDXbyIINGrLGgDYbXnumtL8l3k9lEP0bW965e+\n058EiCKdEHyaD6GUYt4FsPh3IJ30y/OgxH1xMCzlc/PMakuS+KxOxAZCuFOpU2dm\n1EFZSukCMwtyHlv8KHL2uGblzGF59qpFjMXA6m0g1Lw1fNgL6PYxGuKR/ccBYF+7\nGE/eE/Z9Gp66+y9sKY/8i09OiSB4lYnmgO3bAudQQdqEkDNP4P/z2mQ07LAGkdkP\nY7Q/QiTJKthyKRv33dkJAtikNsryIxezWEZ4amUFboMjRaefCfS6Lzgl+hikfKQ3\nmYe0Lp8ART1jvDdWijc0\n=/jcS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-09T20:04:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","follo