ps://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/frame-ui-components/commits/c2ef56e54d3a7567cd7d15b9f95f8ef7a34314cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T20:20:30Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T20:20:30Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: initial @ojfbot/frame-ui-components package\n\nShared prop-only UI components for the Frame OS ecosystem:\n- BadgeButton: Carbon Tag-based action button (8 color variants, sm/md sizes)\n- MarkdownMessage: ReactMarkdown renderer with GFM, action links, suggestions\n- ErrorBoundary: React error boundary with fallback prop + callback\n- Dashboard.css: canonical dashboard layout (shell-mode flex chain, sidebar, tabs)\n- BadgeButton.css + MarkdownMessage.css: shared component styles\n\nAll components are pure/prop-only — no Redux, no store, no hooks beyond React core.\nStorybook configured at port 6007 with Carbon styles + dark/light backgrounds.\n\nExtracted from identical implementations across cv-builder, blogengine, tripplanner,\ncore-reader, and gastown-pilot. MarkdownMessage removes the Redux dispatch fallback\n(onExecute is now purely callback-driven).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7899578fa0c54c06affd11c6b5050f1b43cbad85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/frame-ui-components/git/trees/7899578fa0c54c06affd11c6b5050f1b43cbad85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/frame-ui-components/git/commits/c2ef56e54d3a7567cd7d15b9f95f8ef7a34314cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_