.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/commits/489c011c01c84d524195b4bf9947e9e06adac950/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T23:46:21Z","email":"40776476+DeibyGS@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Deibyg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T23:46:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: AI Development Benchmark (#26)\n\n* docs: add AI Development Benchmark (process focus)\n\n* fix(backend): resolve failing CI — timezone-aware datetimes, typed exceptions, ruff clean\n\n- Make datetime.now()/strptime() tz-aware (DTZ005/007/011) using Europe/Madrid where local time matters and UTC for API timestamps\n- Replace blind except Exception (BLE001) with concrete SDK errors: genai_errors.APIError, HttpError, OSError, OperationalError, binascii.Error\n- Auto-fix import ordering/annotations (I001, UP045, PLR0402, PIE790, F401)\n- Fix date timebomb in test_calendar.py (hardcoded 2026-04-01 -> relative future date)\n- CI: ruff check backend/src passes, pytest 85/85 green\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Deibyg <40776476+deiybg@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f91e53b0158044c90509f79722067085338a8d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/trees/f91e53b0158044c90509f79722067085338a8d10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/commits/489c011c01c84d524195b4bf9947e9e06adac950","verification":{"payload":"tree f91e53b0158044c90509f79722067085338a8d10\nparent a01b39a889d2adc0de84804fbbb4f27889e73797\nauthor Deibyg <40776476+DeibyGS@users.noreply.github.com> 1786059981 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786059981 +0200\n\ndocs: AI Development Benchmark (#26)\n\n* docs: add AI Development Benchmark (process focus)\n\n* fix(backend): resolve failing CI — timezone-aware datetimes, typed exceptions, ruff clean\n\n- Make datetime.now()/strptime() tz-aware (DTZ005/007/011) using Europe/Madrid where local time matters and UTC for API timestamps\n- Replace blind except Exception (BL