ettingsPage (/settings): edit MAX_EMAILS_PER_RUN, CHECK_INTERVAL_MINUTES,\n  GMAIL_FILTER_AFTER_DATE, QUIET_HOURS_START, QUIET_HOURS_END\n- Added QUIET_HOURS_START / QUIET_HOURS_END to settings.py (previously hardcoded)\n- Navbar: added \"Ajustes\" link\n\nTESTS:\n- 11 new tests for SettingsPage (87% coverage)\n- Updated test_scheduler.py to reflect manual scheduling behavior\n- Backend: 98/98 · Frontend: 93/93\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35edd6581ffeb40a6078d5ee57579df104e2d031","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/trees/35edd6581ffeb40a6078d5ee57579df104e2d031"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/commits/08fb0c42286aad311af989ec4b58e2ade7df1556","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40776476?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DeibyGS","id":40776476,"login":"DeibyGS","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzc2NDc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/commit/08fb0c42286aad311af989ec4b58e2ade7df1556","node_id":"C_kwDORrvrUtoAKDA4ZmIwYzQyMjg2YWFkMzExYWY5ODllYzRiNThlMmFkZTdkZjE1NTY","parents":[{"htm