ciones precisas, reglas de prioridad entre categorías,\n  resumen enriquecido (2-3 líneas + acción requerida), conversión de zona horaria\n  a Europe/Madrid, detección mejorada de recurrencia con ejemplos, y aviso\n  explícito sobre adjuntos .ics procesados por código.\n- Amplía VALID_CATEGORIES con 4 nuevas: factura, soporte, notificacion, urgente.\n- Añade colores semánticos en theme.ts para las 4 nuevas categorías y completa\n  recordatorio y personal que faltaban; mantiene alias ''informativo'' para legacy.\n- Añade 7 tests nuevos en test_classifier.py: validación del tamaño y contenido\n  de VALID_CATEGORIES, tests por categoría nueva, y test de fallback a ''otro''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cf05417bf8ac8b52d820bb66ebf3d2ffd186a42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/trees/0cf05417bf8ac8b52d820bb66ebf3d2ffd186a42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/commits/616ef85b1002cc357a5211d88db283aec44d4ed7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40776476?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DeibyGS","id":40776476,"login":"DeibyGS","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzc2NDc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h