feat(gmail): parse .ics attachments for reliable event extraction\n\n- gmail/client.py: _extract_ics_attachments() detects and downloads .ics\n  attachments (inline or via attachmentId) from Gmail messages\n- classifier.py: extract_event_from_ics() parses first VEVENT from .ics\n  using icalendar library — extracts title, date, time, location,\n  description and RRULE; _rrule_to_pattern() converts RRULE to internal\n  format (DAILY / WEEKLY:days / MONTHLY:day)\n- classify_email() prioritizes .ics data over Gemini extraction\n- calendar/client.py: if date is None but recurrence exists, default to\n  today as series start date; discard events with past dates\n- classifier.py: pass current date to Gemini prompt for date context\n- requirements.txt: add icalendar==7.0.3\n- test_classifier.py: 18 new tests (extract_event_from_ics + _rrule_to_pattern)\n- test_api.py: fix stale mock (create_event_from_email → create_event)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c901c066e172bb8380921f43f37c0e60fe147cf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/trees/c901c066e172bb8380921f43f37c0e60fe147cf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/commits/ae2b880e33e603af601b328bff4de7f6ec456e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40776476?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DeibyGS","id":40776476,"login":"DeibyGS","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzc2NDc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/received_event