tps://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/commits/d8ac44a5a39075bd8ae26be41c4138db4d25d90a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:30:35Z","email":"40776476+deiybg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Deibyg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:30:35Z","email":"40776476+deiybg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Deibyg"},"message":"fix(calendar): corregir delete not found, NaN date en create y manejo de HttpError\n\nBUG 1 & 2 (delete/edit not found):\n- Importar HttpError de googleapiclient.errors para chequear el status HTTP\n  real (e.resp.status) en vez de buscar \"404\" en el string del error\n- Ahora distingue 404 (not found) y 410 (already deleted) de otros errores API\n\nBUG 3 (NaN invalid date al crear evento):\n- Añadir función create_event() independiente, usada por el router (separada\n  de create_event_from_email que es para el flujo de IA)\n- Corregir end.date para eventos de día completo: debe ser el día siguiente\n  (Google Calendar usa extremo exclusivo), antes se ponía el mismo día\n- _parse_event robusto: usa ''or {}'' para start/end null-safe, y fallback ''''\n  para que start/end sean siempre strings, nunca null (evita new Date(null))\n- El router ahora captura ValueError de create_event y devuelve 422\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bb295ca3e1f0c40df35efb32adfaaa1ee8129a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/trees/5bb295ca3e1f0c40df35efb32adfaaa1ee8129a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/commits/d8ac44a5a39075bd8ae26be41c4138db4d25d90a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40776476?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/user