ub.com/users/DeibyGS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeibyGS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/commits/6c6e872394588439bfc4da83f1b44f12a40f05e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:04:06Z","email":"40776476+deiybg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Deibyg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:04:06Z","email":"40776476+deiybg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Deibyg"},"message":"fix(frontend): hover effects, empty state, calendar CSS, toasts + fix NaN fecha\n\n- Hover effects profesionales: glow en .btn-primary, borde iluminado en\n  .btn-secondary, glow rojo en .btn-danger, via CSS classes en index.css\n- Empty state glassmorphism en bandeja de correos vacía (EmptyInboxCard)\n- Calendar CSS: toolbar buttons con color #E5E7EB legible, off-range días\n  con fondo rgba(11,15,25,0.6), today con acento violeta sutil\n- Toasts sonner: loading → success/error al crear/editar/eliminar eventos\n- Reemplazados todos los alert() de CalendarPage con toast.error()\n- Toaster configurado en App.tsx con dark theme + acento design system\n\nfix(backend): NaN Invalid Date al crear eventos desde el calendario\n  create_event_from_email ahora llama _parse_event() antes de retornar,\n  normalizando start/end de objetos {dateTime:...} a strings planos\n  que el frontend puede parsear con new Date() sin NaN.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71b7e16c8d5ffa6d99045cb8100e5ac396771ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/trees/71b7e16c8d5ffa6d99045cb8100e5ac396771ae6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeibyGS/gmail-ai-agent/git/commits/6c6e872394588439bfc4da83f1b44f12a40f0