54f840957a063224554ef9c08f15c87ad7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71704013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/laithalenooz","id":71704013,"login":"laithalenooz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzA0MDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/e92af8bb0ea62cd7c0413c6b77bba9e75aa2b0d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:17:27Z","email":"laithalenooz@gmail.com","name":"laithalenooz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:17:27Z","email":"laithalenooz@gmail.com","name":"laithalenooz"},"message":"fix(automation): fire tag_added only when the tag is actually added (#554)\n\nThe tag_added trigger matched whenever the configured tag was present on the\ntask, and every update to the tags field produced a tag_added candidate. Any\nlater, unrelated tag edit (or a removal) therefore re-fired automations whose\ntag had been added long before, which in multi-stage review pipelines made\ntasks bounce back to earlier stages and started duplicate agent runs.\n\nThe consumer now derives the tags an update added from the change''s old and\nnew values and passes them to trigger matching: a configured tag must be\namong them (and still present on the task), and an unconfigured tag_added\ntrigger needs at least one addition. Removal-only edits no longer produce a\ntag_added candidate.\n\nFixes #554","tree":{"sha":"c84f09d2dce04e2496539bb4863c61be39855035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/trees/c84f09d2dce04e2496539bb4863c61be39855035"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/commits/e92af8bb0ea62cd7c0413c6b77bba9e75aa2b0d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71704013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/laithalenooz","id":71704013,"login":"laithalenooz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzA0MDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca/commit/e92af8bb0ea62cd7c0413c6b77bba9e75aa2b0d8","node_id":"C_kwDORr3H_toAKGU5MmFmOGJiMGVhNjJjZDdjMDQxM2M2Yjc3YmJhOWU3NWFhMmIwZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca/commit/6791ae2c8cc1a893b0c6799cf7d24df303e8e0b0","sha":"6791ae2c8cc1a893b0c6799cf7d24df303e8e0b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/6791ae2c8cc1a893b0c6799cf7d24df303e8e0b0"}],"sha":"e92af8bb0ea62cd7c0413c6b77bba9e75aa2b0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/e92af8bb0ea62cd7c0413c6b77bba9e75aa2b0d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54643926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vhervatin","id":54643926,"login":"vhervatin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NjQzOTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/88bca4fa753bf51373b254a93740856be874bf02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:21:28Z","email":"54643926+vhervatin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vitor Hervatin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:21:28Z","email":"54643926+vhervatin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vitor Hervatin"},"message":"fix(test): use net.ListenConfig.Listen in email_test.go (noctx lint)\n\nThe repo-wide `golangci-lint run ./...` (api-pr-ci''s Lint job) fails on\n`net.Listen` in email_test.go, added by 27b1029d (the GHSA-f2mf-mg99-22w5\nnetguard fix) — a pre-existing violation unrelated to this PR''s change,\nbut it turns the Lint check red on every PR built against current master.\nSwitch to (*net.ListenConfig).Listen with context, exactly as the noctx\nlinter prescribes, so the Lint job passes. `golangci-lint run ./...` is\nnow clean (0 issues).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35e51747828402b45d980ec0704f693fd5df91b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/trees/35e51747828402b45d980ec0704f693fd5df91b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/commits/88bca4fa753bf51373b254a93740856be874bf02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54643926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vhervatin","id":54643926,"login":"vhervatin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NjQzOTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca/commit/88bca4fa753bf51373b254a93740856be874bf02","node_id":"C_kwDORr3H_toAKDg4YmNhNGZhNzUzYmY1MTM3M2IyNTRhOTM3NDA4NTZiZTg3NGJmMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca/commit/1ec9d2d765993dfe6fc86298260764a3ebb9fa8e","sha":"1ec9d2d765993dfe6fc86298260764a3ebb9fa8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/1ec9d2d765993dfe6fc86298260764a3ebb9fa8e"}],"sha":"88bca4fa753bf51373b254a93740856be874bf02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/88bca4fa753bf51373b254a93740856be874bf02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54643926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vhervatin","id":54643926,"login":"vhervatin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NjQzOTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vhervatin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/1ec9d2d765993dfe6fc86298260764a3ebb9fa8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:34:52Z","email":"54643926+vhervatin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vitor Hervatin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:18:48Z","email":"54643926+vhervatin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vitor Hervatin"},"message":"perf(notification): title-only lookup + payload assertion test\n\nAddresses the PR review:\n- entity_title now resolves via dedicated FindTaskTitleByID /\n  FindDocumentTitleByID (SELECT title) instead of FindTaskByID /\n  FindDocumentByID, which pulled the full row (task description JSONB +\n  a second assignee query; full document content) just to read a title\n  on the synchronous comment/doc-update path.\n- The publisher is now an eventPublisher interface so a unit test can\n  capture the published payload and assert entity_title carries the\n  resolved title — not only that the lookup ran.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree