Z","email":"hvhai22@gmail.com","name":"pikann22"},"message":"fix(plugin): route paca.send_email dials through netguard (GHSA-f2mf-mg99-22w5)\n\nsend_email dialed plugin-supplied host:port with a plain net.Dialer, bypassing\nthe private/loopback/link-local IP protection applied to paca.fetch. Dial via\nnetguard.SafeDialContext and layer implicit TLS on top; add regression test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f681eac5a90799f16a9052f089393faf68f17e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/trees/f681eac5a90799f16a9052f089393faf68f17e96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/commits/27b1029d59129fbdefbebe153dd2ed12bada09e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41873019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pikann","id":41873019,"login":"pikann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODczMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca/commit/27b1029d59129fbdefbebe153dd2ed12bada09e2","node_id":"C_kwDORr3H_toAKDI3YjEwMjlkNTkxMjlmYmRlZmJlYmUxNTNkZDJlZDEyYmFkYTA5ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca/commit/17a139f60fde46263aed0792535b26