019,"login":"pikann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODczMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/1255c407ef6cffa19b6d9fe413190ed871ceb3b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:33:34Z","email":"hvhai22@gmail.com","name":"pikann22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:33:52Z","email":"hvhai22@gmail.com","name":"pikann22"},"message":"fix(plugin): validate plugin names and contain uninstall paths (GHSA-ph34-wrxh-vwxc)\n\nPlugin names were stored unvalidated and later joined onto the plugin roots\nand passed to os.RemoveAll in Installer.Uninstall, allowing a plugins.write\nholder to delete arbitrary host paths via ''..'' segments.\n\n- Add plugindom.ValidatePluginName (dot-separated [A-Za-z0-9_-] segments) and\n  enforce it in InstallPlugin and the installer.\n- Add safePluginDir containment check; Uninstall verifies every root before\n  deleting anything, which also protects pre-existing bad rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c40a95bea0bba189020a0459752fe5feac780145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/trees/c40a95bea0bba189020a0459752fe5feac780145"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/commits/1255c407ef6cffa19b6d9fe413190ed871ceb3b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41873019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/events{/privacy}","followers_url