"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/commits/cc3bf31a1cfb4c3a60b2d185458fa8d8c282c5d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:05:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:05:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(jev): only apply autofill answers to questions that were asked\n\nA Jev-compatible provider returning extra answer keys could write fields\nthe consumer deliberately left out of the request, e.g. one excluded via\nthe project''s autofill_excluded_fields setting. Drop unasked answers\nbefore building the update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EWTZBUJ3onPz8ZumN5tznU","tree":{"sha":"8e660f616dcf557ee5e7fee3032e58db7dba8b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/trees/8e660f616dcf557ee5e7fee3032e58db7dba8b38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca/git/commits/cc3bf31a1cfb4c3a60b2d185458fa8d8c282c5d6","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e660f616dcf557ee5e7fee3032e58db7dba8b38\nparent 840d3686bb51b14c49667b23e821fe58e1af0a37\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790233538 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790233538 +0000\n\nfix(jev): only apply autofill answers to questions that were asked\n\nA Jev-compatible provider returning extra answer keys could write fields\nthe consumer deliberately left out of the request, e.g. one excluded via\nthe project''s autofill_excluded_fields setting. Drop unasked answers\nbefore building the update.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EWTZBUJ3onPz8ZumN5tznU\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAA