ep3221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pradeep3221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pradeep3221/AI-DLC/commits/f7b88d5e62ef28a25e5efc9a8475f76b1ec440ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T13:08:37Z","email":"pradeep3221@gmail.com","name":"Pradeep Kumar Katakam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T13:08:37Z","email":"pradeep3221@gmail.com","name":"Pradeep Kumar Katakam"},"message":"feat: Add prompt library configuration and unit test generation documentation\n\n- Created `prompt-library-config.yaml` for centralized configuration of Prompt-as-Code execution, including global settings, AI tool compatibility, language/framework configurations, SDLC phases, project types, agent configurations, prompt preferences, guardrails, workflows, execution settings, context management, and versioning.\n- Added `unit-test-generation.md` to provide guidelines for generating comprehensive unit tests, including structure, coverage goals, examples for .NET and Python, and testing strategies.\n- Introduced `README.md` in the shared directory to outline shared components and utilities for the AI-DLC framework.\n- Added `bolt-sprint-template.md` for structuring sprint information, scope, deliverables, implementation planning, and testing strategy.\n- Created `mob-elaboration-template.md` to guide mob elaboration sessions, including session information, agenda, requirements summary, architectural decisions, testing strategy, and follow-up actions.","tree":{"sha":"707e751b5c5d09bd7df2f943fabbb95fd30c209a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pradeep3221/AI-DLC/git/trees/707e751b5c5d09bd7df2f943fabbb95fd30c209a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pradeep3221/AI-DLC/git/commits/f7b88d5e62ef28a25e5efc9a8475f76b1ec440ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verif