nizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/eb2c12619988d4b9da73eafc56ee917735051d5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:51:37Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:51:37Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"test(shell): e2e motivo-autocomplete happy path + silent degradation (T15, specs/014)\n\nTwo Playwright journeys through the real assembled shell host + refund-ui\nremote against the real auth/refund-api services (ADR-0006 — a federated\nremote has no standalone authed bootstrap, so this lives in shell/e2e/,\nnever in refund-ui):\n\n1. Happy path — a brand-new employee is granted the refund permission set,\n   five past travel_km lines are seeded through the REAL API, a fresh draft\n   is opened, Travel by car chosen, three characters typed, and the\n   fold-merged suggestion is navigated to and picked BY KEYBOARD ONLY\n   (Tab to the field, ArrowDown/ArrowUp, Enter — AC-5.6/5.3). Asserts the\n   three filled fields, the untouched date, the recomputed km x rate\n   breakdown, that nothing was saved (AC-3.7), and only then adds the line.\n2. Degradation — page.route(''**/line-suggestions*'').abort() with a KNOWN\n   NON-EMPTY corpus, so the missing list can only be caused by the injected\n   failure. Asserts the absence of every surface AC-5.2/AC-1.6 forbid (no\n   listbox, no role=alert, no banner, no composer error, no shell toast,\n   empty polite live region) and that the line still composes and adds.\n\nEach run mints a unique @operai.test employee, so the self-scoped corpus\n(AC-4.1/4.2) is exactly what the run seeds — deterministic against the\nshared local dev DB, and an incidental live check of the owner scoping.","tree":{"sha":"517065cc250a49e7f50176f6edd0e428f51342ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/517065cc250a49e7f50176f6edd0e428f51342ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/eb2c12619988d4b9da73eafc56ee917735051d5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/eb2c12619988d4b9da73eafc56ee917735051d5c","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKGViMmMxMjYxOTk4OGQ0YjlkYTczZWFmYzU2ZWU5MTc3MzUwNTFkNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/c5d7f6ede9cf1988f7e1172364ae5f9fdee929e8","sha":"c5d7f6ede9cf198