src/test-support/testAuth.ts), cleaned with\ntruncateRefundTables().\n\nCovers the plan''s AC->test table: AC-2.1/2.2/2.3/2.4/2.5/2.6, AC-1.7,\nAC-4.1/4.2/4.3/4.4, plan D7, and a registration-order regression test that\ndemonstrates the /requests/{id} swallow trap rather than asserting it from\nmemory.\n\nAC-2.4 is written against dates computed with the SAME Date.UTC month\narithmetic as the cutoff, so the 25-months-out / 23-months-in relationship\nholds on every calendar day the suite is ever run.\n\nVerified non-vacuous by mutation: dropping the owner scope fails 6 tests,\ndropping the date cutoff fails AC-2.4, displaying the fold fails AC-2.5\n(5 unit + 7 integration), and 404-instead-of-403 fails AC-4.3.","tree":{"sha":"cc8bfdfc3ddbdee8afb0e5b20b34d0c6a1eef0f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/cc8bfdfc3ddbdee8afb0e5b20b34d0c6a1eef0f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/2eedf07a8a3a96b3add04ac904ce648524b0cf5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/2eedf07a8a3a96b3add04ac904ce648524b0cf5a","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDJlZWRmMDdhOGEzYTk2YjNhZGQwNGFjOTA0Y2U2NDg1MjRiMGNmNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2","sha":"7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2"}],"sha":"2eedf07a8a3a96b3add04ac904ce648524b0cf5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/2eedf07a8a3a96b3add04ac904ce648524b0cf5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:17:59Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:17:59Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(refund-api): add GET /line-suggestions (T5, specs/014)\n\njwtMiddleware -> authzMiddleware -> the EXISTING request:read capability (no\nnew catalog permission, no auth change at all — ADR-0042). Capability absent\nis 403, never 404: there is no record being addressed, so there is no\nexistence to hide.\n\nThe handler ignores the resolved grant''s CONDITIONS entirely and passes only\nthe verified JWT sub to the repo, so an unconditioned/global request:review\ncannot widen this personal-data read (AC-4.2). ADR-0015''s entity-scope\npredicate is deliberately not consulted — it is a review concept, this is a\nself-scoped read.\n\n400 (not 422) on query-validation failure, matching rates/effective.routes.ts.\nCache-Control: no-store on both the 200 and the 403 (plan D7, RFC 9111).\n\nMounted at TOP LEVEL. Under /requests/... it would have been swallowed by\nrequestsRouter''s GET /requests/{id} as id=\"line-suggestions\" and answered\nwith that route''s ownership 404 — a silent, total feature outage no type\nchecker can catch.","tree":{"sha":"8d626224b725a6601260f772b588990138747e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/8d626224b725a6601260f772b588990138747e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDdhOTc1OTUxN2Q5MmVkYWMyNDY4ZGMyODNmYjU4NDgzZGY0MjBjZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e","sha":"0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e"}],"sha":"7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7a9759517d92edac2468dc283fb58483df420cd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:11:57Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:11:57Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(refund-api): add the self-scoped travel_km trip-triple query (T3, specs/014)\n\nPrisma groupBy on (motivo, km, entity) with _count + _max(date), filtered to\ntype=travel_km and date >= a 24-month UTC cutoff computed per request, scoped\nby a request relation filter on the verified JWT sub.\n\nThe function takes NO authorization context — an entity/review scope is a\nreview concept and this is a self-scoped read, so there is no parameter\nthrough which a global request:review grant could widen the result (ADR-0042).\nWidening is inexpressible, not merely denied.\n\nNo status filter (AC-2.6, draft included), no entity filter (entity is part of\nthe trip signature, not a scope), no text filter (the typed query never\nreaches this service at all). No schema change, no migration, no new index.","tree":{"sha":"8e10d8e1612ed3a8b6f9582df73c41f81b668b34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/8e10d8e1612ed3a8b6f9582df73c41f81b668b34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDBmODE4NDZmNGVjYTIyNmUwMmU3NzQ0NDQ0YjJiNTI2NGQxMThlMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/c8599621f0be0f9be3efb8798232c4f47e69435f","sha":"c8599621f0be0f9be3efb8798232c4f47e69435f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/c8599621f0be0f9be3efb8798232c4f47e69435f"}],"sha":"0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/0f81846f4eca226e02e7744444b2b5264d118e1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/c8599621f0be0f9be3efb8798232c4f47e69435f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:10:18Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T14:10:18Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(refund-api): fold-merge, rank and cap trip signatures (T4, specs/014)\n\nPure — no Prisma, no Hono, no clock of its own. SQL collapses exact\n(motivo, km, entity) triples; this merges the ones whose motivo folds equal\n(AC-2.1) while carrying the most recent constituent''s verbatim motivo as\ndisplay text (AC-2.5), then applies plan D8''s deterministic total order and\nD5''s 200-signature cap.\n\nTwo tiebreaks the ACs leave open are pinned here so a response cannot flap\nover identical data: the display-text election falls back to count desc then\ncode-unit order, and every string comparison is code-unit (never\nlocaleCompare, which is ICU-version sensitive).\n\nsuggestionWindowCutoff lives here rather than in the repo because it is pure\nand is the one piece of AC-2.4 that can be unit-tested without a database;\nthe repo imports it.","tree":{"sha":"422db7d7430a66ebcd4d08c4c41c182b2903dc13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/422db7d7430a66ebcd4d08c4c41c182b2903dc13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/c8599621f0be0f9be3efb8798232c4f47e69435f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"htt