ived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/39571048ffbcbc9d2c1c628e78ce94b1d512a880/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T08:04:54Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T08:24:32Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"docs(infra): make NOTIFY_INTERNAL_URL a shared variable\n\nIt is one value used by three services (auth, refund-api, estimai-api) but was\ndocumented as a per-service variable, so it was hand-copied three times and\ndrifted three times — auth and refund-api on 2026-07-31, estimai-api silently\nfrom the day specs/013 shipped until it surfaced in production.\n\nNOTIFY_INTERNAL_TOKEN was already on the shared list for exactly this reason;\nthe URL that pairs with it was not. Adds it to the shared table and repoints\nall three per-service rows at ${{shared.NOTIFY_INTERNAL_URL}}, keeping the\nliteral recorded once as the shared variable''s value.\n\nSharing it also answers the private-domain question once instead of per\nservice, and turns a future rename into a one-line fix rather than three\nindependent silent outages.","tree":{"sha":"0ccdd120bc76043a078444298b59951bc02552eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/0ccdd120bc76043a078444298b59951bc02552eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/39571048ffbcbc9d2c1c628e78ce94b1d512a880","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/39571048ffbcbc9d2c1c628e78ce94b1d512a880","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDM5NTcxMDQ4ZmZiY2JjOWQyYzFjNjI4ZTc4Y2U5NGIxZDUxMmE4ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d","sha":"73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d"}],"sha":"39571048ffbcbc9d2c1c628e78ce94b1d512a880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/39571048ffbcbc9d2c1c628e78ce94b1d512a880"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T07:37:44Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T08:24:32Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"docs(infra): fix the NOTIFY_INTERNAL_URL guidance — reference resolves empty, use the literal\n\nThe runbook warned that notify-api''s private domain is operai.railway.internal\n(not notify-api.railway.internal), then prescribed\n${{notify-api.RAILWAY_PRIVATE_DOMAIN}}:${{notify-api.PORT}} — which matches no\nservice and resolves to an empty string, collapsing the value to ''http://:''.\n${{operai.RAILWAY_PRIVATE_DOMAIN}} resolves empty too (verified 2026-08-10).\n\nSix prescriptions now use the literal http://operai.railway.internal:8080,\ntaken from notify-api''s own Settings → Private Networking panel. The port is\nconfirmed by its public-domain mapping and startup log.\n\nScoped deliberately, NOT a blanket rule: ${{Postgres.RAILWAY_PRIVATE_DOMAIN}}\nand ${{auth.RAILWAY_PRIVATE_DOMAIN}} both resolve correctly today, so the\nguidance is ''prefer the reference, verify the resolved value, fall back to the\nliteral'' — with ''http://:'' documented as the tell that a key matched nothing.\n\nThird occurrence of this trap: auth and refund-api both held a broken literal\non 2026-07-31; estimai-api has been dropping every collaborator notification\nsince specs/013 shipped.","tree":{"sha":"f11ca2da199f40486a7119ff224549fee8a3dae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/f11ca2da199f40486a7119ff224549fee8a3dae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDczMTUyNDIxZWM3Yjk2ZDE0YjQwYTFiNWUxOTRjMzhjNWI1NjY1OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24","sha":"7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24"}],"sha":"73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/73152421ec7b96d14b40a1b5e194c38c5b56658d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T08:16:14Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T08:16:14Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"fix(estimai-ui): stop the shortcuts button overlapping the shell footer\n\nThe affordance was `fixed bottom-0 right-0`, anchoring it to the VIEWPORT.\nInside the shell the viewport''s bottom-right corner is exactly where the\nshell''s own footer (version + copyright) sits, so the two rendered on top of\neach other.\n\n`sticky bottom-0` keeps the always-visible behaviour `fixed` provided while\nscoping it to <main>''s own scroll container (ShellLayout gives <main>\n`relative` + `overflow-y-auto`), so it now stops above the shell chrome.\n\nShellLayout''s comment blessed this fixed footer, but only on a11y-landmark\ngrounds — a nested <footer> is not a contentinfo landmark. The visual\ncollision was never considered. The general rule, added as a comment: a\nfederated remote must not position anything against the viewport, because\nthat space belongs to the shell (ADR-0006).\n\nVerified by reproducing the shell''s frame (h-screen flex column, relative\noverflow-y-auto main, shrink-0 footer): before, the button''s rect (811-833)\nfalls inside the footer''s (806-837) — overlaps:true; after, it sits above it\nat both scroll extremes — overlaps:false, and still visible when scrolled to\nthe very bottom.","tree":{"sha":"3178c7d5dcc9b04093e6a032250b4367ff527576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/3178c7d5dcc9b04093e6a032250b4367ff527576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDdhNGZhNmE3MTBiNzYzOTQyMmIyMmIzMzYxY2Y2NGQ2N2EyZWZmMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/c6f71c0f3b70cfacd6267652f3626a0e8111dfba","sha":"c6f71c0f3b70cfacd6267652f3626a0e8111dfba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/c6f71c0f3b70cfacd6267652f3626a0e8111dfba"}],"sha":"7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7a4fa6a710b7639422b22b3361cf64d67a2eff24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/c6f71c0f3b70cfacd6267652f3626a0e8111dfba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T07:40:30Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T07:40:30Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-ui)!: remove the anonymous link share — Collaborators is the only sharing mechanism\n\nDeletes the ''Share link'' toolbar button and everything behind it: shareUrl.ts\n(lz-string encode/decode), SharedEstimatePage, the /share route, QrModal, the\nShift+Q shortcut, and the lz-string/qrcode dependencies.\n\nThe client PDF''s ''Scan to view online'' QR went with it — it encoded a share\nlink, so with the /share route gone it would have been a dead link on every\nPDF. generateQrWithLogo is removed; svgToDataUrl (the PDF logo) stays.\n\nBREAKING: previously-shared #data= URLs and QRs on already-sent client PDFs no\nlonger resolve. The estimate payload lived in the URL itself, so nothing is\nlost server-side; the links simply stop rendering. An estimate can now only be\nviewed by an Operai user holding EstimAI access, so there is no longer a\nclient-facing read-only view — accepted at removal time.\n\nspecs/013''s US-8 (which existed to PROTECT this mechanism) is annotated as\nsuperseded; AC-8.1/AC-8.2 are recorded as no longer satisfiable. T24''s\nregression guard is replaced by assertions that prove the ABSENCE of any\nlink-share affordance and of the /share route.","tree":{"sha":"ee8a178fb1f3bdd3eab8eb1bc79808bc8d86dede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/ee8a178fb1f3bdd3eab8eb1bc79808bc8d86dede"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/c6f71c0f3b70cfacd6267652f3626a0e8111dfba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_i