https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/8d45e6f65291ababe0a2957945bb6fee54c9f955/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T08:41:35Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T08:41:35Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"fix(estimai-ui): align @tanstack/react-router with the other frontends, drop the seroval override\n\nThe override pinned seroval >=1.5.3 to clear GHSA-mv8w-475r-vwqw while leaving\nestimai-ui''s lockfile on router-core@1.168.2. All five frontends already declare\n^1.168.2; only estimai-ui''s lock had never been refreshed, so it alone carried the\nvulnerable transitive seroval. Refreshing it resolves router-core@1.171.19 and\nseroval@1.6.2 naturally, so the override is no longer doing anything and is removed.\n\nSide benefit: estimai-ui''s router now matches the shell''s (1.171.x) rather than\ntrailing it by three minors, which matters because the router is a shared Module\nFederation singleton.","tree":{"sha":"eaf6ae468a4f615b7e7e9602954cb9445cbbd96f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/eaf6ae468a4f615b7e7e9602954cb9445cbbd96f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/8d45e6f65291ababe0a2957945bb6fee54c9f955","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}