teocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/cc4aa817c9602bf04e89f21b4e180e140f545e9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:36:18Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:37:01Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"test(estimai-ui): link-share regression guard (T24, specs/013)\n\nSharedEstimatePage.tsx and shareUrl.ts stay byte-unchanged (guarded only,\nper the task''s touch note) — this only extends the existing\nSharedEstimatePage.test.tsx with T22''s guard:\n\n- performs no apiFetch call at all, proving the unauthenticated\n  `/share#data=...` path never reaches the network (a real regression if it\n  ever did, per AC-8.1).\n- rendering a #data= payload shows no AccessLevelBadge, no\n  CollaboratorsDialog, no T22 toolbar Collaborators button/chip, and no\n  \"Shared with you\"/\"collaborator\" copy — only the pre-existing plain-text\n  author field (AC-8.2: the two sharing mechanisms stay visually and\n  functionally distinct).\n\nAll existing tests in this file (and the untouched buildShareUrl behavior\nelsewhere) pass unmodified.","tree":{"sha":"6464d0a6be362e03a55b14cf42dcff801b1871b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/6464d0a6be362e03a55b14cf42dcff801b1871b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/cc4aa817c9602bf04e89f21b4e180