ers/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/5c4c3958bb4173267107c69559adb7bac1f079a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:34:36Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:37:01Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-ui): toolbar composition — \"Share link\" relabel + Collaborators entry/chip (T22, specs/013)\n\nTwo permanent, differently-shaped toolbar entries per design.md''s \"Toolbar\ncomposition decision\" — never a shared button, never a dropdown with two\nmodes (AC-8.1/AC-8.2):\n\n- The existing Share button is relabelled \"Share link\" (strings.ts) with\n  its icon, color, click handler (buildShareUrl + clipboard) and copied-\n  state feedback all unchanged.\n- A new \"Collaborators\" button (people glyph, neutral border, count badge\n  from `collaboratorCount`) sits in its own group behind a divider, owner\n  only. It opens CollaboratorsDialog in owner mode.\n- A collaborator sees a non-actionable-looking \"Shared by {owner} · {level}\"\n  pill chip in that same slot instead, opening the same dialog in its\n  read-only member mode.\n\nEstimatorContext gains `owner`/`collaboratorCount` (T22 extension, mirroring\nT16''s `access`/`version` pattern) so EstimatorApp — the dialog''s only real\ncaller — can read them without a page-level prop; EstimatePage threads them\nthrough from `EstimateFull`.\n\nAlso fixes EstimatorApp.test.tsx''s stale `EstimateFull` fixture (missing\nversion/access/owner) — the last remaining `pnpm build` failure on this\nbranch, left for this task by T16''s fixture note — and disambiguates\nEstimatorApp.viewerGating.test.tsx''s loose `/share/i` query, which the new\n\"Shared by...\" chip copy now also matches in ''viewer'' access mode.","tree":{"sha":"e71e3f3190a1fc82f064e52ea5891cb7c592f7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/e71e3f3190a1fc82f064e52ea5891cb7c592f7d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/5c4c3958bb4173267107c69559adb7bac1f079a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi