85f46aca954591d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/783b5fda6b4e6610ec43db07ae6dce9966d6c0e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:07:33Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:21:00Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-ui): CollaboratorsDialog member mode + Leave (T21, specs/013)\n\nAdds the second render branch to CollaboratorsDialog for access !== ''owner'':\nno add form, no collaborator list (the API never returns other collaborators\nto a non-owner), just \"Shared with you by {owner}\" (via formatIdentity, so\norphaned owners render correctly), the caller''s own access level, and one\nLeave action confirmed through T19''s generalized ConfirmDeleteModal, calling\nDELETE .../collaborators/me. Default focus goes to the dialog heading\n(tabIndex={-1} + programmatic focus, PermissionDenied.tsx''s technique) since\nthere''s no input to land on. No Leave affordance is ever rendered for\naccess === ''owner'' (AC-6.2).","tree":{"sha":"5d1cb30d5626f6d848f1d37f938edaa65bab14fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/5d1cb30d5626f6d848f1d37f938edaa65bab14fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/783b5fda6b4e6610ec43db07ae6dce9966d6c0e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/783b5fda6b4e6610ec43db07ae6dce9966d6c0e9","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDc4M2I1ZmRhNmI0ZTY2MTBlYzQzZGIwN2FlNmRjZTk5NjZkNmMwZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e","sha":"322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e"}],"sha":"783b5fda6b4e6610ec43db07ae6dce9966d6c0e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/783b5fda6b4e6610ec43db07ae6dce9966d6c0e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:20:01Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:21:00Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"test(estimai-api): cross-service test — owner soft-delete leaves the estimate untouched (T12, specs/013)\n\nDrives auth''s real DELETE /admin/users/:id (withAudit + real Prisma writes\nagainst the real operai_auth DB) against a seeded owner, then asserts:\nestimai-api''s estimate row and every collaborator grant are byte-identical\nafterwards; a fetch spy proves auth''s soft-delete path makes zero network\ncalls (AC-10.1 is the absence of a mechanism, not a no-op cascade); the\neditor''s GET/PUT and the viewer''s GET still succeed; every remaining\ncollaborator gets 403 owner_only on DELETE /estimates/{id} and on all\ncollaborator-management routes; and an exact-set route-table assertion\nproves no ownership-reassignment route exists, as a tripwire against a\nfuture \"admin re-homes an orphaned estimate\" change.","tree":{"sha":"e9937930a756c92c7bac0963a04cbd765a6b8ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/e9937930a756c92c7bac0963a04cbd765a6b8ada"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDMyMmRhYzNkM2Q2Zjk5Y2IyYjMyYzljYjE2MDYxNGQzNTBiYTZmMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/5d104bd94fc7d1ddbc568c717a74476841938021","sha":"5d104bd94fc7d1ddbc568c717a74476841938021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/5d104bd94fc7d1ddbc568c717a74476841938021"}],"sha":"322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/322dac3d3d6f99cb2b32c9cb160614d350ba6f1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/5d104bd94fc7d1ddbc568c717a74476841938021/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:16:51Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:21:00Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-api): OpenAPI registration for the five collaborator routes (T11, specs/013)\n\nAdds src/openapi/collaborators.docs.ts: registers GET/POST\n/estimates/{id}/collaborators, PATCH/DELETE\n/estimates/{id}/collaborators/{collaboratorId}, and DELETE\n/estimates/{id}/collaborators/me for /openapi.json and the Scalar\nreference, via OpenAPIHono''s openAPIRegistry.registerPath — doc-only,\nzero change to collaborators.routes.ts''s plain .get()/.post()/... handlers\nor their fixed 9-step validation order (T8''s deliberate choice; declarative\nrequest.body validation would invert resolveAccess-before-body-parsing).\nAdds ProblemSchema/ProblemWithCodeSchema to collaborators.schemas.ts for\nthe new error-code responses, and a \"Collaborators\" tag to registry.ts.\n\nAlso fixes a real bug T6''s agent had flagged for verification: estimatesRouter''s\nwildcard jwtMiddleware, once merged into `app`''s route table by\nOpenAPIHono.route(), shadowed /openapi.json and /docs (both registered on\n`app` afterward) and returned 401 for both. index.ts now calls\nsetupOpenAPI(app) before importEstimatesRouter/estimatesRouter are mounted,\nand registerCollaboratorOpenApiDocs(estimatesRouter) before that router\nitself is mounted (mirroring registerCollaboratorRoutes''s existing\ncall-before-mount rule) — verified live (curl against a running instance)\nand with a regression test reproducing the bug in the reverted order.","tree":{"sha":"2a10e9ee85088178ede6d9e64fe5a77a0cbbf3d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/2a10e9ee85088178ede6d9e64fe5a77a0cbbf3d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/5d104bd94fc7d1ddbc568c717a74476841938021","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","or