9efb8b82a4c0798136ed92f4295e5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:36:54Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:55:54Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-ui): estimates list — shared indicator, owner identity, orphaned rows (T23, specs/013)\n\nShared rows (access !== ''owner'') now render an AccessLevelBadge, the\nowner''s identity via formatIdentity (deleted/unknown routed through the\nsame placeholder, never blank/raw-id/error), and omit the owner-only\nDelete action — including on orphaned rows. Rows are distinguishable by\ndata-testid (estimate-row-owned/estimate-row-shared), never by CSS class\nalone. The empty state already keyed off the combined list returned by\nestimatesApi.list(), so only test coverage was added for AC-2.3.\n\nFixed EstimatesPage.test.tsx''s two stale EstimateListItem fixtures\n(missing access/owner after T15''s type widening) and added tests for\nshared-row distinguishability, orphaned/unknown owner rendering, and\ncombined-list empty-state gating.","tree":{"sha":"2321b207233ee38f2c375aa9a3f1094ec403d605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/2321b207233ee38f2c375aa9a3f1094ec403d605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/77218b1a8e9efb8b82a4c0798136ed92f4295e5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","