om/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/7ff8ef9f0ad7838606e9bb274da7314d58411b48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:12:08Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:27:30Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-ui): context access/canEdit/version, autosave gating and conflict suppression (T16, specs/013)\n\n- EstimatorContext gains access/canEdit/version/conflict: canEdit is\n  derived once (access !== ''viewer'', plan risk R5) rather than\n  re-derived per component; the autosave effect (a) never runs when\n  !canEdit, (b) sends If-Match with the tracked version and adopts the\n  server''s returned version on success, (c) on ConflictError (409 or\n  428) enters a conflict state and suspends every future autosave\n  attempt until the provider remounts, leaving name/author/params/\n  releases/acts untouched (AC-4.2).\n- EstimatePage passes initialAccess/initialVersion through and moves\n  providerKey from estimate.updatedAt to estimate.version, so a future\n  route invalidate (T18''s \"Reload latest\") remounts the provider fresh.\n- Fixes stale EstimateFull/EstimateListItem fixture literals in\n  EstimatorContext.test.tsx and ConfirmDeleteModal.test.tsx left by\n  T15''s type widening (access/owner/version now required) — the tree\n  did not typecheck until these were updated.","tree":{"sha":"c7c0fdc7269e346ce83228714c2b763d810bae49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/c7c0fdc7269e346ce83228714c2b763d810bae49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/comm