":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/85407e09b9800325039918165500c66b4a28a733/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:08:29Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:27:30Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(auth): rate-limit POST /authz/users/identities (T27, specs/013)\n\nCloses the drift T3 documented: plan.md''s contract lists 429 +\nRetry-After for this route, but neither plan.md nor T1 provisioned a\nlimit/window for it, so it shipped unthrottled. Reuses T1''s existing\ncreateSlidingWindowRateLimiter with a new IDENTITIES_RATE_LIMIT (120)\n/ IDENTITIES_RATE_WINDOW_MS (600000) env pair, keyed by caller sub,\nmirroring appAccessCheck.routes.ts''s 429 Problem JSON + Retry-After\nshape. Deliberately no response-time floor here (ADR-0039).","tree":{"sha":"adb799cbc5250738cc5c27abdf2407afbd9bfd6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/adb799cbc5250738cc5c27abdf2407afbd9bfd6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/85407e09b9800325039918165500c66b4a28a733","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/85407e09b9800325039918165500c66b4a28a733","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDg1NDA3ZTA5Yjk4MDAzMjUwMzk5MTgxNjU1MDBjNjZiNGEyOGE3MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3","sha":"9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3"}],"sha":"85407e09b9800325039918165500c66b4a28a733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/85407e09b9800325039918165500c66b4a28a733"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:26:51Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:27:30Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-api): add GET/POST /estimates/{id}/collaborators add path (T8, specs/013)\n\nImplements the plan''s 9-step handler order for adding a collaborator:\nresolveAccess (404/403) before the rate limiter and before the auth call,\na fast self-check off the JWT email claim, a duplicate check on\n(estimateId, email), auth eligibility with a fail-closed 503 and a single\nfloored 422 generic rejection for both ineligibility causes, a definitive\npost-lookup self-check on the resolved userId, and an INSERT whose unique-\nviolation maps to 409 already_collaborator. GET is owner-only and returns\nthe grant''s id, never a sub.\n\nRoutes attach to the existing estimatesRouter via a new\nregisterCollaboratorRoutes(router, deps) function (called from index.ts)\nrather than a side-effect import mutating the shared singleton — this\nkeeps the endpoint fully unit-testable in isolation, since bun test shares\none module cache across every test file and estimates.routes.test.ts\nalready owns its own jwt-middleware mock bound to that same singleton.\n\nNotification wiring (plan step 9, AC-7.1) is deliberately deferred to T10.","tree":{"sha":"0d4ed2ebc974db6a1f05ef12bd6453dc705952c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/0d4ed2ebc974db6a1f05ef12bd6453dc705952c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDlmMmI5MDVmMzU1NjQyYmIwZmRkOGI2MGE5OTVmZTE0Y2NmOTBiYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/b0a33639615eb8e8f4235ba88d8f7a749f9c5ca4","sha":"b0a33639615eb8e8f4235ba88d8f7a749f9c5ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/b0a33639615eb8e8f4235ba88d8f7a749f9c5ca4"}],"sha":"9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/9f2b905f355642bb0fdd8b60a995fe14ccf90bb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/b0a33639615eb8e8f4235ba88d8f7a749f9c5ca4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:15:17Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T19:27:30Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-api): optimistic concurrency — version CAS, If-Match/ETag, 409/428 (T7, specs/013)\n\nReplaces updateEstimate''s owner-only predicate with a single-statement CAS\n(updateMany where: {id, version, OR:[owner, editor-grant]}, version:\nincrement(1)) so the access check and the version check share one atomic\nwrite — no TOCTOU window. If-Match is now REQUIRED on PUT (absent/malformed\n→ 428 precondition_required); a stale version → 409 estimate_version_conflict\ncarrying currentVersion/updatedAt/best-effort lastModifiedBy. GET/PUT 200\nresponses now carry an ETag: \"<version>\" header. Evaluation order is fixed\n(401→400→428→413→404/403→409) so a stranger''s probe never elicits a 409.\n\nAdds ConflictError to the shared error union. Updates every pre-existing PUT\ncall site in estimates.routes.test.ts to send If-Match (T7 makes it\nmandatory) and adds a dedicated T7 test suite: ETag wiring, required/malformed\nIf-Match, evaluation-order guards, stale-version 409, a Promise.all\nconcurrent-write race (exactly one 200/one 409, version +1, content =\nwinner''s), the same-owner-two-tabs case, the CAS-predicate test (a viewer\nwith a correct If-Match still gets 403, never 409), and an editor''s\nsuccessful write.\n\nVerified Prisma''s collaborators relation-filter compiles to a single atomic\nUPDATE (confirmed via 8x repeated runs of the concurrency test) — the R8\n$executeRaw/EXISTS fallback was not needed.","tree":{"sha":"2660312c8e4abed297945a1645366123ee1a76cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/2660312c8e4abed297945a1645366123ee1a76cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/b0a33639615eb8e8f4235ba88d8f7a749f9c5ca4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:/