5,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/0119c69a4e3e2127b53468f78110cd1a9766967d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:11:45Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:22:54Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(estimai-ui): typed API clients for sharing — collaboratorsApi, estimatesApi If-Match/ConflictError (T15, specs/013)\n\n- New src/lib/collaboratorsApi.ts: typed wrappers over the five collaborator\n  endpoints, reusing estimatesApi''s ApiError/ApiProblem/EstimateIdentity. Every\n  named error code in plan.md''s contract table gets its own ApiError subclass\n  (OwnerOnlyError, InvalidInputError, AlreadyCollaboratorError,\n  CannotShareWithSelfError, CollaboratorNotEligibleError, RateLimitedError,\n  AuthorizationServiceUnavailableError, NotACollaboratorError) so callers can\n  instanceof-branch onto a designed state instead of parsing detail strings.\n- estimatesApi.ts: EstimateFull/EstimateListItem gain access/owner/version;\n  ApiProblem/ApiError gain an optional code; update() now requires a version\n  argument and always sends If-Match (ADR-0038 — absent precondition is a 428,\n  never a silent last-write-wins fallback). A new ConflictError subclass\n  carries currentVersion/updatedAt/lastModifiedBy; both 409 and 428 funnel\n  through the same ConflictError path.\n- estimatesApi.test.ts: update() coverage extended for the required If-Match\n  header and the 409/428 ConflictError path; fixtures updated for the new\n  required fields.\n\nAll calls go through the existing apiFetch interceptor (ADR-0001) — no second\nfetch path introduced.","tree":{"sha":"2a73a451a0c4cb4780e301cc8dd65bcc5c02beb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/2a73a451a0c4cb4780e301cc8dd65bcc5c02beb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/0119c69a4e3e2127b53468f78110cd1a9766967d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/0119c69a4e3e2127b53468f78110cd1a9766967d","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDAxMTljNjlhNGUzZTIxMjdiNTM0NjhmNzgxMTBjZDFhOTc2Njk2N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/456a37d2456502ec19dea57e799f4a0a8c107071","sha":"456a37d2456502ec19dea57e799f4a0