omy: no relationship\n-> 404 (ADR-0005 intact), relationship but insufficient level -> 403 (new\nForbiddenError, ADR-0037). EstimateListItem/EstimateFull gain access/owner\n(live-resolved via authClient.resolveIdentities, fail-soft) and\nEstimateFull gains version/collaboratorCount. updateEstimate''s predicate is\nleft owner-only (CAS + editor-grant predicate is T7''s scope) with only its\nresponse shape widened to satisfy the shared contract.","tree":{"sha":"56d732f15da144e656e292e9fd437aca9ab22407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/56d732f15da144e656e292e9fd437aca9ab22407"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/3d94b4de535295a0aca42276acbb6cae812b674c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/3d94b4de535295a0aca42276acbb6cae812b674c","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDNkOTRiNGRlNTM1Mjk1YTBhY2E0MjI3NmFjYmI2Y2FlODEyYjY3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850","sha":"091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850"}],"sha":"3d94b4de535295a0aca42276acbb6cae812b674c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/3d94b4de535295a0aca42276acbb6cae812b674c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:20:22Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:22:54Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(auth): POST /authz/users/identities id-keyed display identity resolution (T3, specs/013)\n\nResolves a caller-held set of ids (1..100) to {id, status, name} for\ndisplay purposes only — never a fact endpoint about access, never a\ndirectory/search endpoint (the ids-only, no email/name/query/prefix/\npagination shape IS the spec''s Non-goal boundary). name is populated\nonly for status:\"active\"; a deleted user resolves to status:\"deleted\"\nwith name:null (AC-10.5 — never a stale identity implying an active\naccount); an id with no matching row resolves to status:\"unknown\". Any\nauthenticated suite user may call it — resolving an id you already hold\nis not itself sensitive.\n\nDrift note (reported, not silently resolved): plan.md''s contract lists a\n429+Retry-After for this route, but neither T1 nor this task provisions a\nrate-limit env var/window for it, and the done-when never tests one — the\nendpoint ships without rate limiting rather than inventing unvalidated\nconstants; see the file''s header doc comment.\n\nTests: all three statuses individually and mixed in one call, the\ndirectory-shape contract test (email/name/query/prefix all rejected),\nempty/over-cap/at-cap ids arrays, no email ever returned, 401.","tree":{"sha":"fb6ccf44a0a9d7bee969164f8d5eb7c449ccecdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/fb6ccf44a0a9d7bee969164f8d5eb7c449ccecdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850","node_id":"C_kwDORsPN3NoAKDA5MTU4MDQ1NmE2MDUxZjJiNTI4OTIxMWIwNzk0NmViMjJmNWM4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno/operai/commit/47b67f66f9916ca327d4334eb61f207fa4cbb85d","sha":"47b67f66f9916ca327d4334eb61f207fa4cbb85d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/47b67f66f9916ca327d4334eb61f207fa4cbb85d"}],"sha":"091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/091580456a6051f2b5289211b07946eb22f5c850"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/matteocodogno","id":6727995,"login":"matteocodogno","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Mjc5OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/47b67f66f9916ca327d4334eb61f207fa4cbb85d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:19:57Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:22:54Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(auth): POST /authz/app-access-check third-party eligibility decision endpoint (T2, specs/013)\n\nAnswers \"does this email belong to an active, appId-access-holding user\"\nas a DECISION never a fact — both negative causes (no-such-user,\nsoft-deleted, lacks-access) collapse to the byte-identical\n{eligible:false} at the source. Caller must hold (appId,\"access\")\nthemselves and not be soft-deleted. The email probe is a parameterised\nlower(email) query against T1''s functional index, resolveEffectivePermissions\nruns on every path (sentinel id when there''s no user, discarded) to equalise\nwork, and every eligible:false is floored to APP_ACCESS_CHECK_FLOOR_MS.\nRate-limited via T1''s sliding-window limiter (40/10min per caller sub, 429 +\nRetry-After).\n\nTests: byte-identical negative bodies, soft-deleted target, caller-gate 403\n(including a soft-deleted caller), malformed input 400, 401, the 41st-call\nrate limit, and a 50-samples-per-cause timing test asserting both medians\n>= floor and differing by < 10% of the floor.","tree":{"sha":"6be20e3a056ef03cc6e3fce0fd3daab1b6ad4e01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/6be20e3a056ef03cc6e3fce0fd3daab1b6ad4e01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/47b67f66f9916ca327d4334eb61f207fa4cbb85d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/event