://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/commits/4c3054b314fa26c16eaf2d7e4eeda8cfa208d458/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:53:50Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T14:57:26Z","email":"matteo.codogno@welld.ch","name":"Matteo Codogno"},"message":"feat(auth): add lower(email) functional index + reusable rate limiter (T1, specs/013)\n\nAdds the functional index `user_email_lower_idx ON \"user\" (lower(email))`\nthat the AC-1.2 anti-enumeration timing guarantee depends on (a Prisma\n`mode: \"insensitive\"` filter emits ILIKE and can''t use it), plus a\nreusable in-process sliding-window rate limiter (the suite''s first) behind\na swappable interface per plan.md R7. New auth env vars\nAPP_ACCESS_CHECK_FLOOR_MS/RATE_LIMIT/RATE_WINDOW_MS wire the limiter''s\ndefaults for the upcoming POST /authz/app-access-check (T2).","tree":{"sha":"9399260d5cd468abfdbc5721db730b2073055fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/trees/9399260d5cd468abfdbc5721db730b2073055fd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matteocodogno/operai/git/commits/4c3054b314fa26c16eaf2d7e4eeda8cfa208d458","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6727995?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodogno/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matteocodo