te":"2026-03-16T14:24:22Z","email":"binh.pham@livekit.io","name":"pham-tuan-binh"},"message":"perf: load training data into RAM instead of mmap for faster batching\n\nRandom-access reads from mmap on a 313K×99×40 file cause constant page\nfaults, bottlenecking training at ~2 step/s. Loading into RAM (~4.7 GB,\nfits in 32 GB) eliminates this. Also vectorized batch assembly with\nnp.concatenate instead of per-sample append loop.","tree":{"sha":"8d2d13e28a179135656bea1339dd4658d55e5d72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/8d2d13e28a179135656bea1339dd4658d55e5d72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/80a18dd8f06fd57dbf67bf7176074f48daa5acf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/80a18dd8f06fd57dbf67bf7176074f48daa5acf5","node_id":"C_kwDORsVVN9oAK