aling convention\n\n- feature-extraction.md: add \"Feature Scaling Convention\" section with\n  table showing how each source (pymicro-features, TF op, HF dataset)\n  handles the ×0.0390625 scaling from uint16 (0–660) to float32 (0–26)\n- overview.md: clarify output scaling range in spectrogram params table\n- training.md: note scaled float32 range in overview diagram and link\n  to scaling docs for negative speech features from HF dataset\n- CLAUDE.md: note feature value range in spectrogram shape description","tree":{"sha":"bf8cf1eb607c8247132d2e2ed67df03cf7023eba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/bf8cf1eb607c8247132d2e2ed67df03cf7023eba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/cc3062a5443be12eb60753f77c83995ccd4a3903","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/cc3062a5443be12eb60753f77c83995ccd4a3903","node_id":"C_kwDORsVVN9oAKGNjMzA2MmE1NDQzYmUxMmViNjA3NTNmNzdjODM5OTVjY2Q0YTM5MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c","sha":"5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c"}],"sha":"cc3062a5443be12eb60753f77c83995ccd4a3903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/cc3062a5443be12eb60753f77c83995ccd4a3903"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T11:38:52Z","email":"binh.pham@livekit.io","name":"pham-tuan-binh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T11:38:52Z","email":"binh.pham@livekit.io","name":"pham-tuan-binh"},"message":"fix: apply uint16→float scaling (×0.0390625) to all feature paths\n\nPer the HuggingFace dataset README: \"multiply by a factor of 0.0390625\nafter casting to a float\". All three feature paths now produce\nconsistently scaled float32 output in the ~0-26 range:\n\n- pymicro-features: already outputs scaled — no change needed\n- TF audio_microfrontend: output as uint16, then scale to float32\n- _convert_ragged_to_npy: cast to float32, then scale\n\nThis is better conditioned for training and matches the intended\nconvention from the dataset authors.","tree":{"sha":"acc950ce0b32a592f36a1c2e735a5fd7caaa7ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/acc950ce0b32a592f36a1c2e735a5fd7caaa7ed8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c","node_id":"C_kwDORsVVN9oAKDVkYjE0MWFkNzVlZjhhZjQ4N2FkMTM3MzdkYTVkZjgyYTc1MmU2MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/c4a7d80e8c43e9add194a73f009f69cbcbe16733","sha":"c4a7d80e8c43e9add194a73f009f69cbcbe16733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/c4a7d80e8c43e9add194a73f009f69cbcbe16733"}],"sha":"5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/5db141ad75ef8af487ad13737da5df82a752e60c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/c4a7d80e8c43e9add194a73f009f69cbcbe16733/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T11:37:23Z","email":"binh.pham@livekit.io","name":"pham-tuan-binh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T11:37:23Z","email":"binh.pham@livekit.io","name":"pham-tuan-binh"},"message":"fix: align feature scaling with microWakeWord precomputed dataset\n\nThe HuggingFace features dataset stores raw uint16 microfrontend output\n(range ~0-660), NOT scaled by 0.0390625. microWakeWord trains on these\nunscaled values.\n\n- TF backend (out_type=tf.float32): already produces unscaled — no change\n- pymicro-features backend: auto-scales to ~0-26 range, so undo the\n  scaling (divide by 0.0390625) to match unscaled convention\n- _convert_ragged_to_npy: cast to float32 only, no scaling (was correct)\n- Add comments documenting the scaling convention at each boundary","tree":{"sha":"9faea8b01b1f5bc8c5cbc1bc71352f92f9c1fc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/9faea8b01b1f5bc8c5cbc1bc71352f92f9c1fc73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/c4a7d80e8c43e9add194a73f009f69cbcbe16733","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ph