dio)\n- Lazy-load training/config imports in __init__.py so the inference API\n  works without torch or pydantic installed\n\n* Move dev dependencies to PEP 735 dependency group\n\ndev tools (pytest, ruff, mypy) are now in [dependency-groups] instead of\n[project.optional-dependencies]. uv syncs these by default so `uv run\npytest` works without --all-extras, and they won''t appear on PyPI.\n\n* Update package author to Binh Pham\n\n* Fix CI to use --group dev instead of --extra dev\n\n* Drop redundant --group dev from CI sync command","tree":{"sha":"6c700ae0bf84e3450eda70bbff1199a64b72a5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/6c700ae0bf84e3450eda70bbff1199a64b72a5d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/898c40cc5a5e33c1f42e681f86f7ad093cf6b934","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c700ae0bf84e3450eda70bbff1199a64b72a5d4\nparent e4ff68389a56b1ff9b4662942b518956f48fc275\nauthor Binh Pham <60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com> 1773642592 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773642592 +0800\n\nPrepare package for PyPI publishing (#44)\n\n* Prepare package for PyPI publishing\n\n- Add PyPI metadata: readme, authors, keywords, classifiers, project URLs\n- Slim core dependencies to numpy + onnxruntime for inference-only installs\n- Move torch, pydantic, typer, and other training deps to [train] extra\n- Add [listener] extra for pyaudio (requires system portaudio)\n- Lazy-load training/config imports in __init__.py so the inference API\n  works without torch or pydantic installed\n\n* Move dev dependencies to PEP 735 dependency group\n\ndev tools (pytest, ruff, mypy) are now in [dependency-groups] instead of\n[project.optional-dependencies]. uv syncs these by default so `uv run\npytest` works without --all-extras, and they won''t appear on PyPI.\n\n* Update package author to Binh Pham\n\n* Fix CI to use --group dev instead of --extra dev\n\n* Drop redundant --group de