(#43)\n\n* Add autostop to SkyPilot training config\n\nAutomatically stop the cluster after 10 minutes of idle time to save\ncosts between training jobs while preserving disk state (ACAV cache).\nUses stop (not down) since Nebius doesn''t support autodown.\n\n* Persist data and output dirs outside workdir for cluster reuse\n\nSymlink ./data and ./output to /home/skypilot/data and\n/home/skypilot/output so ACAV features, RIRs, backgrounds, and\ngenerated audio survive workdir re-syncs across sky exec calls.\n\n* Fix hardcoded home path to use ~ for portability\n\n/home/skypilot/ may not exist on Nebius VMs (likely /home/ubuntu/).\nUse ~/persistent/ which resolves to the correct home directory.","tree":{"sha":"9ae5de80e794f437cda8c20cfc2ccd8b95993e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/9ae5de80e794f437cda8c20cfc2ccd8b95993e37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/e4ff68389a56b1ff9b4662942b518956f48fc275","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ae5de80e794f437cda8c20cfc2ccd8b95993e37\nparent bcdb7c49f5c2de8240c6e0def45b416f18254378\nauthor Binh Pham <60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com> 1773379300 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773379300 +0800\n\nAdd autostop and persist data dirs for SkyPilot cluster reuse (#43)\n\n* Add autostop to SkyPilot training config\n\nAutomatically stop the cluster after 10 minutes of idle time to save\ncosts between training jobs while preserving disk state (ACAV cache).\nUses stop (not down) since Nebius doesn''t support autodown.\n\n* Persist data and output dirs outside workdir for cluster reuse\n\nSymlink ./data and ./output to /home/skypilot/data and\n/home/skypilot/output so ACAV features, RIRs, backgrounds, and\ngenerated audio survive workdir re-syncs across sky exec calls.\n\n* Fix hardcoded home path to use ~ for portability\n\n/home/skypilot/ may not exist on Nebius VMs (likely /home/ubuntu/).\nUse ~/persistent/ which re