tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/b5e2f38021b3f0539a44ada5bffa09da0abdfb28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T10:30:41Z","email":"60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Binh Pham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T10:30:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add training metrics logging and feature validation (#33)\n\n* Save training metrics to metrics.json in the output directory\n\nLogs FPPH, recall, accuracy, phase, step, and elapsed time at each\nvalidation point during training. The file is flushed to disk after\nevery entry so it can be inspected mid-run. A final entry with\nnote \"final_averaged\" records the averaged checkpoint''s metrics.\n\n* Validate ACAV feature dimensions and warn when ACAV is missing\n\n- Raise ValueError if loaded features have embedding dim != 96,\n  catching stale or incompatible pre-computed features early\n- Log a warning when ACAV100M features are not found so training\n  without general negatives is never silent","tree":{"sha":"5a0c7a19fbf74c19c04bcbdb0d84ad0a5030d572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/5a0c7a19fbf74c19c04bcbdb0d84ad0a5030d572"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/b5e2f38021b3f0539a44ada5bffa09da0abdfb28","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a0c7a19fbf74c19c04bcbdb0d84ad0a5030d572\nparent 725a8799e80e50fdc5d3e992418071da34fe9944\nauthor Binh Pham <60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com> 1772965841 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772965841 +0800\n\nAdd training metrics logging and feature validation (#33)\n\n* Save training metrics to metrics.json in the output directory\n\nLogs FPPH, recall, accuracy, phase, step, and elapsed time at each\nvalidation point during training. The file is flushed to disk after\nevery entry so it can be inspected mid-run. A final entry with\nnote \"final_averaged\" records the averaged checkpoint''s metrics.\n\n* Validate ACAV feature dimensions and warn when ACAV is missing\n\n- Raise ValueError if loaded features have embedding dim != 96,\n  catching stale or incompatible pre-computed features early\n- Log a warning when ACAV100M features are not found so training\n  without general negatives is never silent","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJprU/RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvwEQACSXEqZTpi1bJEaEcGIr5/h3\nQQBXZmZ+Ay9fQQsDTrokn1nwCS5fBzBb5mDfgESEZ6vbun/M9xmiGLfmhAGn5WKG\naqXpqi6bjyDySfJDdkJzH+lMTbKvBcx6l/8J/Py8g1tQz5rGlwBRVex11T6ILf4E\ninvbxASJaYF3LUIcROioNRvNaxM737eMdJr+d9J0IWTOU3s3WbPBYdM5kJwv5oR2\nZEaEeyq1vlbdoQiODEI3d9o1FyLO2EhHQ+MCnImVmvDITCfK2PUCrIG38Pp2FRUq\na//aB1JxMZV1XG34He11XRcCmzXKL1ihnegV6p1cxNM7JSVOt5vQwXsKQScY3NDf\nXRMJHl0JxgxiP5FOze1Y4FY6qp1OTSZQo+MnTwfWX+PYtQWXqM7KS95qGiem748J\nGX9p6BMqvqQ9FJ3dy+UeeDlG2G/eHPSH/dr5+UdAzTxtx4yVzBSBgPURbzBPUvNV\n0wLUWNv91N7LUdWeQiDcY6ZlOQP+4SAAznkpz7dCx2tgBvVhelDodMQNOinh5cCe\nxhgCjc2HewcRwiHPS7cmerbNRp3QjXcYVrbf7R2clDxf8mDHWrX5kJegWPZNnY8Z\ntav1doTVDX0rxxbDwJuB9abj+n0s8hqVVhYZA0XJs/t/poOm4i7D+7CAeAGjZvM9\na17MfXSej2nFbcQ6J7/q\n=greY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-20T16:00:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/b5e2f38021b3f0539a44ada5bffa09da0abdfb28","node_id":"C_kwDORsVVN9oAKGI1ZTJmMzgwMjFiM2YwNTM5YTQ0YWRhNWJmZmEwOWRhMGFiZGZiMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commit/725a8799e80e50fdc5d3e992418071da34fe9944","sha":"725a8799e80e50fdc5d3e992418071da34fe9944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/725a8799e80e50fdc5d3e992418071da34fe9944"}],"sha":"b5e2f38021b3f0539a44ada5bffa09da0abdfb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/b5e2f38021b3f0539a44ada5bffa09da0abdfb28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60741317?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/725a8799e80e50fdc5d3e992418071da34fe9944/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T05:56:56Z","email":"60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Binh Pham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T05:56:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Switch adversarial generation to regex phoneme replacement (#32) (#32)\n\nReplace the hand-curated SIMILAR_PHONEMES substitution map with\nOWW-style regex phoneme replacement via pronouncing.search(). This\ngenerates regex patterns by replacing 1 to N-2 phonemes with a broad\nwildcard (.){1,3}, finding both close and moderately-distant phonetic\nneighbors in CMUDict.\n\nKey changes:\n- Remove SIMILAR_PHONEMES map and reverse phoneme index\n- Add _phoneme_replacements() for combinatorial regex pattern generation\n- Add _get_word_phonemes() with stress-wildcard support for vowels\n- Default n_phrases to None (no cap) instead of 200\n- Keep _expand_unknown_words() for compound/brand-name handling\n\nThis produces ~8,000-12,000 unique adversarial phrases (vs ~20-50\nbefore), and works for words like \"alexa\" and \"jarvis\" where the old\napproach found zero matches.","tree":{"sha":"f1474f3333e9f3b427874bff62abf6c238de34d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/f1474f3333e9f3b427874bff62abf6c238de34d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/725a8799e80e50fdc5d3e992418071da34fe9944","verification":{"payload":"tree f1474f3333e9f3b427874bff62abf6c238de34d5\nparent eb53ece4e27283e967d6644a23860536029b7b90\nauthor Binh Pham <60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com> 1772863016 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772863016 +0800\n\nSwitch adversarial generation to regex phoneme replacement (#32) (#32)\n\nReplace the hand-curated SIMILAR_PHONEMES substitution map with\nOWW-style regex phoneme replacement via pronouncing.search(). This\ngenerates regex patterns by replacing 1 to N-2 phonemes with a broad\nwildcard (.){1,3}, finding both close and moderately-distant phonetic\nneighbors in CMUDict.\n\nKey changes:\n- Remove SIMILAR_PHONEMES map and reverse phoneme index\n- Add _phoneme_replacements() for combinatorial regex pattern generation\n- Add _get_word_phonemes() with stress-wildcard support for vowels\n- Default n_phrases to None (no cap) instead of 200\n- Keep _expand_unknown_words() for compound/brand-name handling\n\nThis produces ~8,000-12,000 unique adversarial phrases (vs ~20-50\nbefore), and works for words like \"alexa\" and \"jarvis\" where the old\napproach found zero matches.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpq74oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1tcQAGNObMrvjstyG6dwryeQ06ho\n/jSvmLn0LnE0IyNal/O0gwGJshnZo00GoKZUOWfk+sWY8ts8pWJUQbnofE5/kSO/\nhmj4UdDH+0IHGqYbw+usie6zpIy2BGtxNMn7ghZ5c9bB3CykYRW5Cvau+f/rFNLV\nWrwzC7ttRS/LsgA6Zu7dDSK10TC82kR0DTneBIYnL2cQ4OdvRRy+ZvjGyS9mga5I\n3x8zZUkCYwQuZff0A86Q69asGx+k+NY4U6BMTu/xqlLuKVXiKuPXpmiouFYD7RYa\nu39xDWY6ryO1pkZu7gXzkKU/Y+zHfTDc3m9O0hanNg349tMVoNNudYk/zoDOQoeX\nBr8yNiQgaxst6m+t347kcF6t2s7bhSPfneDnELNVqb6k/cx/moF/zz3yQ67iP6gw\nudbrJlu05ctvIgFpvaQkaO9U3Ozr7KTUY74akoFC/aFHnFYRm68A5G54eznZoiIa\n8Z69Jtwe5+qR+yaI1qHLL0gAUsWAwpfurLr10gnZqd3L+0lPlNziENtI4cFUp2FF\nkCqhne3BkJ3LmFvOWr2RnVsPQzAdz9uSSbBnxGxmOQBmq5fxHqRacxkwbpGk5Ae/\nwOHfRsN2WccxOErPU9TJP4qlwHxA55G6nM6HWm3ksy/fKlbETH9ljMFYf4ReaXmJ\nc/0YYWkYNMWh1vm5Bf+X\n=Rx6d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-20T16:00:39Z"}},"com