an-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/83499cf478ed8d5de9a19a63f9ff14f2b8fff158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T16:41:33Z","email":"60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Binh Pham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T16:41:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Vendor VITS model code, remove piper-train dependency (#22)\n\n* Vendor VITS model code from piper-train with type annotations\n\nCopy the ~2100-line VITS TTS model implementation from piper-train into\nsrc/livekit/wakeword/data/_vits/ so we can drop the external dependency.\nAll functions and methods are fully annotated for mypy strict mode with\nzero type: ignore comments.\n\n* Remove piper-train dependency, load VITS via state_dict\n\nReplace unsafe pickle-based checkpoint loading with state_dict + config\nJSON. This removes the piper-train Git dependency and all its workarounds\n(uv overrides, sys.modules shims, weights_only=False).\n\n- Add _load_vits_model() using SynthesizerTrn from vendored _vits\n- Update CLI to download state_dict .pt and .json config separately\n- Delete _piper_generate_compat.py (sys.modules shim no longer needed)\n- Remove piper-train from [train] extras and uv source/override config\n- Add ruff per-file-ignores for vendored code (E741)\n\n* Point VITS model download URLs to livekit-wakeword v0.1.0 release","tree":{"sha":"012ea8660d4237d52d321b8e88ea2d9a55a7147b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/012ea8660d4237d52d321b8e88ea2d9a55a7147b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/83499cf478ed8d5de9a19a63f9ff14f2b8fff158","verification":{"payload":"tree 012ea8660d4237d52d321b8e88ea2d9a55a7147b\nparent 05019584dbee41740ca345cb42be30f591b841b9\nauthor Binh Pham <60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com> 1772296893 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772296893 +0800\n\nVendor VITS model code, remove piper-train dependency (#22)\n\n* Vendor VITS model code from piper-train with type annotations\n\nCopy the ~2100-line VITS TTS model implementation from piper-train into\nsrc/livekit/wakeword/data/_vits/ so we can drop the external dependency.\nAll functions and methods are fully annotated for mypy strict mode with\nzero type: ignore comments.\n\n* Remove piper-train dependency, load VITS via state_dict\n\nReplace unsafe pickle-based checkpoint loading with state_dict + config\nJSON. This removes the piper-train Git dependency and all its workarounds\n(uv overrides, sys.modules shims, weights_only=False).\n\n- Add _load_vits_model() using SynthesizerTrn from vendored _vits\n- Update CLI to download state_dict .pt and .json config separately\n- Delete _piper_generate_compat.py (sys.modules shim no longer needed)\n- Remove piper-train from [train] extras and uv source/override config\n- Add ruff per-file-ignores for vendored code (E741)\n\n* Point VITS model download URLs to livekit-wakeword v0.1.0 release","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpoxq9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4A4QAIqDNP6TdM16spoI+85ML61Q\nl4Xu6XPHgOF6i6Mwg/SMCqMzwx4EqdpcfHvleLgIhY4npt2Q/PK03X3d24pWTXXy\neL6cxyu