api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh","id":60741317,"login":"pham-tuan-binh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNzQxMzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pham-tuan-binh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/commits/5e01315124924e208ecc12f8b5a41e9752a16880/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T05:08:45Z","email":"60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Binh Pham"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T05:08:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Hardcode 2.0s clip duration, remove compute_clip_duration() (#16)\n\nThe dynamic clip duration calculation (median + 750ms, min 2.0s) was\nunnecessary — the model always takes the last 16 embedding windows\nregardless of clip length, and the feature extractor already left-pads\nif there aren''t enough windows. Hardcoding 2.0s simplifies the pipeline.\n\n- Delete compute_clip_duration() from generate.py\n- Change run_generate() return type from float to None\n- Remove clip_duration parameter from run_augment(), hardcode 2.0\n- Update CLI, README, and docs accordingly","tree":{"sha":"3231e7ffc9b5b5b1b5f31167cc5393d8b5e86c8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/trees/3231e7ffc9b5b5b1b5f31167cc5393d8b5e86c8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit-embedded-wakeword/git/commits/5e01315124924e208ecc12f8b5a41e9752a16880","verification":{"payload":"tree 3231e7ffc9b5b5b1b5f31167cc5393d8b5e86c8a\nparent a9bd29fe5aab956ba212210f70e0855f03d0b85b\nauthor Binh Pham <60741317+pham-tuan-binh@users.noreply.github.com> 1772255325 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772255325 +0800\n\nHardcode 2.0s clip duration, remove compute_clip_duration() (#16)\n\nThe dynamic clip duration calculation (median + 750ms, min 2.0s) was\nunnecessary — the model always takes the last 16 embedding windows\nregardless of clip length, and the feature extractor already left-pads\nif there aren''t enough windows. Hardcoding 2.0s simplifies the pipeline.\n\n- Delete compute_clip_duration() from generate.py\n- Change run_generate() return type from float to None\n- Remove clip_duration parameter from run_augment(), hardcode 2.0\n- Update CLI, README, and docs accordingly","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJponhdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACSAQABKfhTh6x2A7zgfnGOZJn9+h\n9F1s6EQ/A5NLfv9hvZXTef8XbzkupajrI/h8uqKzXzMFHh+WZYClXPtCPauddkBx\nFOo4TQYdtGcFvmu1W5q3IBdg0wkaIfxAqpcRwyfv1YA4MlcWC98rEJlV/NSsWW4e\negWXZYsoRw6BhjzhYaCTLrtIdSxro6jEP+oEUmoZTqr1MNBiwq4S9Gf+zb8APT9+\n9TqzacB6YgP+le0GYQhDLpV+o42x+1aZcANPUg31RdQ4CcWSRvNbdmuwT0EKbyxb\nO91iJGPX65jZtx8gs+d+Ubg+Wrgpc4UtSv6Kg0SU6gW9zPpAlnRYbBubjrco8RlH\nLAepmCm8Zf0mvl00IRAmfQdxEBpvv1SQReb7z78F3vKS2WOPj+wg/PAKpI1fxxNR\nQuDKKvU8SO29g16th1fxGMlrFNWOCU/xYGy6xt54RLFZj5oVJZo4SyorHgF3UYuz\nnQ0jkfjr3X4/b+d0a6eLc/MRdHXXu0Xh9s1OxYNLHPOm/ADctMSGAvnJK56xPTg7\n45nyZHOus9TcTDDoeDdapkOCI69DbVVjFs2hSNEr4wgWvItRcVuochxioruKv9YD\nbjkzuC8vdnOtJRvROqOnimoHZVcEIE24PGF0E/Ed1cebiXE6us4UAfVZykRHLtDj\n3XNXTnnuisbztOYcKBTd\n=ko9a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-20T16:00:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","foll