tps://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commits/852c2286b888d3b76f218b5fa0f7a006edcf2516/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T07:27:42Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T07:27:42Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"message":"feat(nestjs): 0.3 redesign — full type inference, scoping, richer hooks\n\ndefineResource now infers T/TId/TCreate/TUpdate from entity + dto classes\ninstead of manual generics. Adds first-class tenant scope config (fails\nclosed by default), five new lifecycle hooks (beforeList/afterList/\nbeforeGet/afterGet/serialize), per-route path/httpCode/pipes/dto/decorator\noverrides, and controller-level guards/interceptors. forTypeOrmResource/\nforMongooseResource gain a one-liner inline-config form. The low-level\nengine moves behind a new /advanced subpath to keep the main entry small.\n\nBreaking (0.x): defineResource''s second generic is now the id key, not the\nid type; import ResourceNestService/Controller/Repository from\n@void-snippets/nestjs/advanced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c352d47c30bb14971baa70dd901621e62c6692ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/trees/c352d47c30bb14971baa70dd901621e62c6692ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/commits/852c2286b888d3b76f218b5fa0f7a006edcf2516","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124019824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sha