eceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commits/4f6b84ac035bc80655ad3305736d7ce0bdaaf44c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T18:26:15Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T18:26:15Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"message":"docs: add @void-snippets/angular to root README\n\nFull documentation section covering:\n- Installation (Angular stack — no axios, HttpClient-based)\n- provideVoidAngular setup with app.config.ts and micro-frontend examples\n- AngularResourceService — abstract base class, methods table, cancellation note\n- createResourceInject — factory signature and injection context requirement\n- MaybeSignal<T> — reactive params section with static vs reactive examples\n- injectList / injectGet / injectMutations / injectInfinite — signature, input/output\n  tables, and complete component examples\n- Optimistic Updates (Angular) — same WeakMap stack as React, concurrent rollback\n- Full Example section — Angular (6 steps: types → service → factory → app.config →\n  list component → detail component)\n- Updated packages table, ToC, Build and Publish commands, directory tree\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e66a70bc36c65ac4a96ccfd24444a3556fd2637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/trees/6e66a70bc36c65ac4a96ccfd24444a3556fd2637"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/commits/4f6b84ac035bc80655ad3305736d7ce0bdaaf44c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"ve