owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh","id":124019824,"login":"shahtirthhh","node_id":"U_kgDOB2RkcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commits/6e19d66e32f6113a5add95c62c9d1fbd74d4087d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:43:56Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:43:56Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"message":"feat(angular): AngularResourceService + IResourceService + provideVoidAngular\n\n- core: add IResourceService<> — shared structural contract for all HTTP\n  implementations; both ResourceService (axios) and AngularResourceService\n  (HttpClient) satisfy it without explicit `implements`\n\n- angular: add AngularResourceService — @Injectable abstract base class using\n  inject(HttpClient); read methods accept AbortSignal and pipe takeUntil() so\n  Angular''s XHR/Fetch backend kills the in-flight request at the OS level when\n  TanStack cancels a query (param change, component unmount)\n\n- angular: add provideVoidAngular() — one-call QueryClient setup for\n  app.config.ts; accepts pre-built QueryClient for micro-frontend isolation\n  or queryClientConfig for simple customisation\n\n- angular: thread AbortSignal through all queryFn calls in createResourceInject\n  (injectList, injectGet, injectInfinite) — activates real network cancellation\n  for AngularResourceService consumers with zero extra code\n\n- angular: createResourceInject now casts apiService to IResourceService instead\n  of the concrete ResourceService — decouples factory from any HTTP impl\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c41f4d095928cae1dde22ecc32c6f5f0ae6aac16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/trees/c41f4d095928cae1dde22ecc32c6f5f0ae6aac16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/commits/6e19d66e32f6113a5add95c62c9d1fbd74d4087d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124019824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh","id":124019824,"login":"shahtirthhh","node_id":"U_kgDOB2RkcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commit/6e19d66e32f6113a5add95c62c9d1fbd74d4087d","node_id":"C_kwDORsbdAtoAKDZlMTlkNjZlMzJmNjExM2E1YWRkOTVjNjJjOWQxZmJkNzRkNDA4N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commit/5b276f9d8995b0b866952ccef83de181bb35921f","sha":"5b276f9d8995b0b866952ccef83de181bb35921f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commits/5b276f9d8995b0b866952ccef83de181bb35921f"}],"sha":"6e19d66e32f6113a5add95c62c9d1fbd74d4087d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commits/6e19d66e32f6113a5add95c62c9d1fbd74d4087d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124019824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh","id":124019824,"login":"shahtirthhh","node_id":"U_kgDOB2RkcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commits/5b276f9d8995b0b866952ccef83de181bb35921f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T10:24:54Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T10:24:54Z","email":"shahtirth0212@gmail.com","name":"shahtirthhh"},"message":"feat: add @void-snippets/angular package with createResourceInject\n\nIntroduces a new Angular-native CRUD resource factory backed by\nTanStack Angular Query. Mirrors createResourceHooks (React) in\nergonomics and optimistic update power, adapted for Angular 19+.\n\nKey additions:\n- createResourceInject — factory returning injectList, injectGet,\n  injectMutations, injectInfinite; all reactive fields are Signals\n- MaybeSignal<T> — accept plain values or Signals as params, making\n  queries automatically reactive when a Signal is passed\n- Full WeakMap optimistic stack ported from createResourceHooks —\n  snapshot/rollback/replay with concurrent mutation handling\n- Zero new required deps; @tanstack/angular-query-experimental and\n  @angular/core declared as peer dependencies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1b80c5f30203f59490c0da4551bef27c14c7f32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/trees/b1b80c5f30203f59490c0da4551bef27c14c7f32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/git/commits/5b276f9d8995b0b866952ccef83de181bb35921f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124019824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh","id":124019824,"login":"shahtirthhh","node_id":"U_kgDOB2RkcA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahtirthhh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shahtirthhh/void-snippets/commit/5b276f9d8995b0b866952