\n\nExtract shared Svelte UI into @lamalibre/sync-panel with abstract SyncClient\ninterface, IIFE microfrontend bundle for Portlama plugin panel, and fetch-based\nclient. Add delegated mTLS certificate enrollment so plugin-mode agents obtain\nPortlama certificates at registration (best-effort). Update all architecture,\ndeployment, and README documentation to reflect the new package structure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44cd895a56caceac18239e039e740130081537f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/trees/44cd895a56caceac18239e039e740130081537f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/commits/2c423a53a9a1afddea46d46928f40fd1b7fc29c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76953139?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/onurvatan-codelama","id":76953139,"login":"onurvatan-codelama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUzMTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lamalibre/sync/commit/2c423a53a9a1afddea46d46928f40fd1b7fc29c7","node_id":"C_kwDORsfJdtoAKDJjNDIzYTUzYTlhMWFmZGRlYTQ2ZDQ2OTI4ZjQwZmQxYjdmYzI5Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lamalibre/sync/commit/bfabb7b787c6b6c7930a1125c13577b8485067c1","sha":"bfabb7b787c6b6c7930a1125c13577b8485067c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/commits/bfabb7b787c6b6c7930a1125c13577b8485067c1"}],"sha":"2c423a53a9a1afddea46d46928f40fd1b7fc29c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/commits/2c423a53a9a1afddea46d46928f40fd1b7fc29c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76953139?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/onurvatan-codelama","id":76953139,"login":"onurvatan-codelama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUzMTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/commits/bfabb7b787c6b6c7930a1125c13577b8485067c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T06:41:45Z","email":"onur.vatan@codelama.com.tr","name":"onurvatan-codelama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T06:41:45Z","email":"onur.vatan@codelama.com.tr","name":"onurvatan-codelama"},"message":"feat: auto-detect Portlama server, install-sync-desktop package, and CI alignment\n\nDesktop app now probes Portlama plugin host (127.0.0.1:9293) then standalone\n(localhost:9393) on startup and auto-configures the server URL. Settings view\nshows detection source and offers a Re-detect button.\n\nNew install-sync-desktop package provides `npx @lamalibre/install-sync-desktop`\nto download and launch the desktop app from GitHub releases.\n\ndesktop-release workflow gains ARM64 Linux target, xdg-utils dep, and Rust\ntoolchain typo fix. release workflow publishes the new installer package.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"578d58567e4847d49c00892190f68eb9b9b9e67c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/trees/578d58567e4847d49c00892190f68eb9b9b9e67c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/commits/bfabb7b787c6b6c7930a1125c13577b8485067c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76953139?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/onurvatan-codelama","id":76953139,"login":"onurvatan-codelama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUzMTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-