 timing-safe setup token comparison, defense-in-depth pattern\nvalidation in agent, trash path traversal protection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55775d4cf21bd0fd309a11355f49998c01783ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/trees/55775d4cf21bd0fd309a11355f49998c01783ed5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/commits/652a40d845b7ffa7b5118ef8dec82975ec2215da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76953139?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/onurvatan-codelama","id":76953139,"login":"onurvatan-codelama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUzMTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lamalibre/sync/commit/652a40d845b7ffa7b5118ef8dec82975ec2215da","node_id":"C_kwDORsfJdtoAKDY1MmE0MGQ4NDViN2ZmYTdiNTExOGVmOGRlYzgyOTc1ZWMyMjE1ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lamalibre/sync/commit/3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8","sha":"3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/commits/3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8"}],"sha":"652a40d845b7ffa7b5118ef8dec82975ec2215da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/commits/652a40d845b7ffa7b5118ef8dec82975ec2215da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76953139?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/onurvatan-codelama","id":76953139,"login":"onurvatan-codelama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUzMTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/commits/3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T16:44:18Z","email":"onur.vatan@codelama.com.tr","name":"onurvatan-codelama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T21:18:58Z","email":"onur.vatan@codelama.com.tr","name":"onurvatan-codelama"},"message":"Initial commit: Sync monorepo\n\nFile synchronization and cloud archive tool. rclone-based bidirectional sync,\narchive/restore (iCloud offload pattern). Dual-mode: standalone + Portlama plugin.\n\nPackages:\n- @lamalibre/sync-server — Fastify REST API\n- @lamalibre/sync-agent — Agent daemon (file watching, rclone execution)\n- @lamalibre/sync-cli — Interactive CLI tool\n- @lamalibre/sync-shared — Shared types, atomic writes, rclone config\n- @lamalibre/create-sync — npx installer\n- @lamalibre/sync-desktop — Tauri/Svelte desktop app\n- @lamalibre/sync-e2e-mcp — Two-VM E2E test infrastructure\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2455adee8a893ae8320a8ac1c7ee8d8dc3b86d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/trees/b2455adee8a893ae8320a8ac1c7ee8d8dc3b86d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lamalibre/sync/git/commits/3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76953139?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/onurvatan-codelama","id":76953139,"login":"onurvatan-codelama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUzMTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onurvatan-codelama","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lamalibre/sync/commit/3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8","node_id":"C_kwDORsfJdtoAKDNlOGFmMTI3YTk5YTA2YTkwYWVlMDBiMDgyYmFhMWYzMjZkYWJmZjg","parents":[],"sha":"3e8af127a99a06a90aee00b082baa1f326dabff8